<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="MRK" style="id">- Nouveau Testament Dondo</book>
  <para style="h">MALAKO</para>
  <para style="toc3">Mlk</para>
  <para style="toc2">Malako</para>
  <para style="toc1">Musamu Wumbote wu Malako</para>
  <para style="mt2">Musamu wumbote wu</para>
  <para style="mt1">Malako</para>
  <para style="imt">Nkotolo</para>
  <para style="ip">Wu ni Musamu Wumbote wusonika Malako. Malako kaba mulongoki wu Yesu ko, kansi wusala na Petelo, mpe wedi kwe zyetingi na Pawuli.</para>
  <para style="ip">Bulendi ba ti misamu mi kasonika mu buuku bedidi, ku Petelo kayuwa myo mu ntangu yi kedi longanga bantu misamu mitadidi luzingu lu Yesu-Klisto ha butoto. Wusonika buuku bedi ku yobobo balembolo ba Bayudayo, mu balonka ti wukedika Yesu Mwana Nzambi kadi.</para>
  <para style="ip">Nzambi wuta mu Masonoma ti: waatambika muntu waakwiza kuula ba-Isaeli, bantu bandi. Yesu bu kayiza ha luse lu butoto belulu, yobobo baba ku Loma bakikotila ku Isaeli mu bataana natee bu babatumimina. Ba-Isaeli bedi kwikila ti Klisto, ni yondowo Nzambi wu kabasiila nsilulu mu bakuula mu moko ma bisi-Loma.</para>
  <para style="ip">Kansi Yesu kayiza mu dyambu di mpulusu beyoyo ko. Wukuula kwandi bantu bebobo babiika mu sadila Satana na masumu, mwanki bamutumimina yandi.</para>
  <para style="ip">Malako wuta mu buuku bedidi misamu mihidika Yesu ha luse lu butoto, bumosi mpe mu mfwilu andi na mfulukulu andi. Yesu wedi longanga mu kibakala ku bantu, wunyakisa zi mbevo, wukuma mpeve zimbi na wuhidika misamu mingitukulu myedi yitukusu bantu. Mpeleko Yesu Mwana Nzambi kadi, kansi kakizangula ko. Mu dyambu ti: «Mwana Muntu kayizidi ko ku bantu mwanki bamusadila, kansi mu sadila na mu haana luzingu lwandi bonso mufutu mu kuula bantu babingi.» <char style="xt"><ref loc="MRK 10:45">Mlk 10.45</ref></char></para>
  <para style="ip">Mintwadisi mi dibundu di Bayudayo ba mubisa natee bu bamuhonda. Kadi muntu waalanda Yesu, fweti kubama mu yena mpasi, kansi manusunu andi yaaba yimbote.</para>
  <para style="iot">Ndandani yi buuku bedidi ebu yidi:</para>
  <para style="io1">1) Ndongolo yi Yoane Mumbotiki (<char style="xt"><ref loc="MRK 1:1-8">1.1-8</ref></char>)</para>
  <para style="io1">2) Mbotokolo yi Yesu na ntontolo zi Satana (<char style="xt"><ref loc="MRK 1:9-13">1.9-13</ref></char>)</para>
  <para style="io1">3) Yesu wuyenda zakala ku kizunga ki Ngalili (<char style="xt"><ref loc="MRK 1:14-9:50">1.14–9.50</ref></char>)</para>
  <para style="io1">4) Yesu wuduuka ku Ngalili mu kwenda ku mbanza Yelusalemi (<char style="xt"><ref loc="MRK 10:1-52">10.1-52</ref></char>)</para>
  <para style="io1">5) Lumingu lu manunu lu Yesu ha luse lu butoto: mfundusu andi na lufwa lwandi (<char style="xt"><ref loc="MRK 11:1-15:47">11.1–15.47</ref></char>)</para>
  <para style="io1">6) Yesu wufuluka mu bafwa (<char style="xt"><ref loc="MRK 16:1-8">16.1-8</ref></char>)</para>
  <para style="io1">7) Yesu wuyenika ku milongoki myandi (<char style="xt"><ref loc="MRK 16:9-20">16.9-20</ref></char>)</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="MRK 1" />
  <para style="s">Ndongolo yi Yoane mubotiki</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 3:1-12">Mat 3.1-12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:1-18">Luk 3.1-18</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 1:19-28">Yoa 1.19-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 1:1" />Eyi ni ntonono yi Musamu Wumbote wu Yesu-Klisto, Mwana wu Nzambi. <verse eid="MRK 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 1:2" />Bonso bu wudi wusonama mu buuku di mumbikudi Yesaya:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 1:2">«Nina tambika ntumwa ani ku mutwala aku,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 1:2">mu ku kubikila nzila.<verse eid="MRK 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 1:3" />Ni ndinga yi muntu yina bokana ku nsi yinkatu:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 1:3">“Kubikeeno nzila yi Mfumu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 1:3">mpe sungikeeno nzila zandi!”»<verse eid="MRK 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 1:4" />Yoane wutotoka ku nsi yinkatu, wedi kwe botikanga bantu, mpe wedi bateelanga ebu: «Viluleeno madyela, mpe botameeno, mwanki Nzambi kalulemvokila masumu meno!» <verse eid="MRK 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 1:5" />Bantu bamvimba ba kizunga ki Yuda na bantu ba mbanza yi Yelusalemi, bedi kwendanga ku yandi, bedi tambudilanga masumu mawu ha meso ma bantu bamvimba na Yoane wedi babotikanga mu nzadi yi Yolodani. <verse eid="MRK 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 1:6" />Yoane wuba wulwata kinkutu ki mika mi kibulu ki nkumbu samo, na wuba wulwata mu luketo lwandi, melika yi mukanda wu kibulu. Makonko na nyosi yi mpanda kedi kwe dyengi. <verse eid="MRK 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 1:7" />Yandi wedi tanga ku bantu ti: «Muntu wuna kwiza ku manima ani, wumvudidi lulendo: Nii wulunga ko mu kondama mu nyanguna misinga mi nsampatu zandi. <verse eid="MRK 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 1:8" />Meno nalubotikidi mu mamba, kansi yandi waalubotika mu Mpeve Yilongo.»<verse eid="MRK 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu wubotoko na wutonto</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 3:13-4:11">Mat 3.13–4.11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:21-22">Luk 3.21-22</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:1-13">4.1-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 1:9" />Mu bilumbu bebyobyo, Yesu wufuma ku mbanza Nazaleti mu kizunga ki Ngalili, mpe Yoane wumubotika mu nzadi yi Yolodani. <verse eid="MRK 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 1:10" />Yesu bu kedi tomboka mu mamba, wuyena mazulu mazibuka na Mpeve Yilongo yikulumuka ku yandi mu kifwani ki bembe. <verse eid="MRK 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 1:11" />Mboki ndinga yiyuwakana tuuka ku yulu: «Ngeye ni mwana ani wunkwe toma tyanga, kyese kyani kimvimba mu ngeye kidi.»<verse eid="MRK 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 1:12" />Hansi na nsi, Mpeve Yilongo yimunata ku nsi yinkatu. <verse eid="MRK 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 1:13" />Yesu wuba ku nsi yinkatu bilumbu makumaya (40), mpe wutonto ku Satana . Wuzakala koko na bibulu bimpanda, na zimbazi ziyiza musadisa.<verse eid="MRK 1:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu wusamuna Musamu Wumbote</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 4:12-17">Mat 4.12-17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:14-15">Luk 4.14-15</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 1:14" />Yoane bu kamana tuulu mu boloko, Yesu wuyenda ku kizunga ki Ngalili, wusamuna koko Musamu Wumbote wu Nzambi, <verse eid="MRK 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 1:15" />mpe wuta ti: «Kilokola kifweni, Kimfumu ki Nzambi kyeka lukufi! Viluleeno madyela, mpe kwikileeno mu Musamu Wumbote!»<verse eid="MRK 1:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu wutumisa milongoki mintete</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 4:18-22">Mat 4.18-22</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:1-11">Luk 5.1-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 1:16" />Yesu bu kedi kwe yendi ha kumu di dyanga di Ngalili, wuyena Simoni na Andele mpangi andi, bedi loosanga mpwasa mu dyanga<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1.16 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">dyanga </char><char style="ft" closed="false">kizinga kikinene ki mamba makwe lembolo kubanga.</char></note>. Mu dyambu ti baba bilobi bi mbizi. <verse eid="MRK 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 1:17" />Yesu wubateela ti: «Ndandeeno, mpe naasa ti luba bilobi bi bantu.» <verse eid="MRK 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 1:18" />Hansi na nsi, basala sisa zimpwasa zawu na bamulanda. <verse eid="MRK 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 1:19" />Bu kayenda mwa kitatu, wuyena Zaki na Yoane mpangi andi, baala ba Zebedayi. Baba mu kati di mulungu na bedi hidikanga zimpwasa zawu. <verse eid="MRK 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 1:20" />Hansi na nsi, Yesu wubatumisa. Basala sisa tata awu Zebedayi na bisadi mu kati di mulungu, ni bamulanda.<verse eid="MRK 1:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu wunyakisa muntu wuba na mpeve yimbi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 4:31-37">Luk 4.31-37</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 1:21" />Yesu na milongoki myandi, bayenda ku mbanza yi Kapenawumi. Mu kilumbu ki saba, wukota mu nzo yi lusambulu yi Bayudayo na wutona mu longa. <verse eid="MRK 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 1:22" />Bantu batoma yituku mu ndongosolo andi, mu dyambu ti wedi longilanga mu lulendo, kansi ka bonso milongisi mi Misiku ko.<verse eid="MRK 1:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 1:23" />Mu kilokola bekyokyo kwandi, mu nzo yi lusambulu yi Bayudayo, muba na bakala dimosi diba na mpeve yimbi. Wulooka mu ngolo ti: <verse eid="MRK 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 1:24" />«[Ha!] Yesu mwisi-Nazaleti, nkye dyambu ngeye na yeto e? Wizidi mu kwiza tufukisa e? Nzebi ngeye nani wudi: Wulongo, Nzambi wu katambikidi!» <verse eid="MRK 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 1:25" />Yesu wubamina yo na wuta ti: «Kanga munwa aku na duuka mu nitu yi bakala bedyodyo!» <verse eid="MRK 1:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 1:26" />Mpeve yimbi yiningisa munkasu bakala bedyodyo na yiduuka mu yandi na muloko wungolo. <verse eid="MRK 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 1:27" />Bantu bamvimba bayituku na bafulasana yawu na yawu ti: «Nkye mpila dyambu di e? Ndongosolo beyiyi yimoona yidi, yina haanu mu lulendo! Wuna haana mpe ntumunu ku mpeve zimbi na zina mutumimina!» <verse eid="MRK 1:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 1:28" />Mpe hansi na nsi kikuumu ki Yesu kimwangana ku ndambu ka ndambu mu kizunga kimvimba ki Ngalili.<verse eid="MRK 1:28" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu wunyakisa buko bu Simoni</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:14-17">Mat 8.14-17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:38-41">Luk 4.38-41</ref>)</para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 1:29" />Bu baduuka mu nzo yi lusambulu yi bayudayo, bayenda ha kimosi na Zaki na Yoane ku nzo yi Simoni na Andele. <verse eid="MRK 1:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 1:30" />Buko bu mukento bu Simoni wuba wulambalala ha mbuka. Yuku-yuku diba nandi. Ni batumbu mu zonzila ku Yesu. <verse eid="MRK 1:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 1:31" />Wuyenda ba bela-bela nandi na wumutedimisa bu kamusimba mu kooko. Yuku-yuku diduuka na wutona mu bakubikila meza.<verse eid="MRK 1:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 1:32" />Mu nkokila, ntangu bu yidyama, bantu banata ku Yesu zimbevo zimvimba na yobobo baba balwatu ku mpeve zimbi. <verse eid="MRK 1:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 1:33" />Bantu ba mbanza yimvimba, bayenda kutakana ha mwelo wu nzo. <verse eid="MRK 1:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 1:34" />Yesu wunyakisa bantu babingi baba na bimbevo bi mumpila-mumpila na wukuma mpe mpeve zimbi zizingi. Wudika mpeve zimbi mu zonza mu dyambu ti yawu bazaba nani yandi kadi.<verse eid="MRK 1:34" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu wusamuna Musamu Wumbote ku Ngalili</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 4:42-44">Luk 4.42-44</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 1:35" />Na mene, mpimpa buna yakidi, Yesu wutemona, wuduuka mu nzo na wuyenda ha kibuka ki yandi hiika mu sambila. <verse eid="MRK 1:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 1:36" />Simoni na yobobo baba nandi batona mu kwe musosi. <verse eid="MRK 1:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 1:37" />Bu bamuyena, bamuteela ti: «Bamvimba bana kusosa.» <verse eid="MRK 1:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 1:38" />Kansi Yesu wubateela ti: «Twendeeno ku ndambu zi hiika, mu mabwala maa bela-bela, mwanki na longa mpe koko Musamu Wumbote, mu dyambu ti musamu wawowo nayizidi.» <verse eid="MRK 1:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 1:39" />Mpe mu kizunga kimvimba ki Ngalili, wedi kwe longingi mu zinzo zi lusambulu zi Bayudayo na wedi kwe kumingi mpeve zimbi.<verse eid="MRK 1:39" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu wunyakisa muntu wuna bwazi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:1-4">Mat 8.1-4</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:12-16">Luk 5.12-16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 1:40" />Muntu wumosi wuu na bwazi wuyiza ku Yesu, wufukama ha ntadisi andi na wumubombidila bu kata ti: «Tala ti tiidi, wulendi mvedisa.» <verse eid="MRK 1:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 1:41" />Yesu wumuyenina kyadi, wulambula kooko, wumusimba na wuta ti: «Ntiidi, bika wuvedila.» <verse eid="MRK 1:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 1:42" />Hansi na nsi, bwazi butumbu manisa na wuvedoso. <verse eid="MRK 1:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 1:43" />Yesu wumuvutula hansi na nsi na wumuzonzila mu nkasu, <verse eid="MRK 1:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 1:44" />wumuteela ti: «Keba kwaku! Kutandi wo ku muntu ko. Kansi yenda wuyenika ku nganga-Nzambi, mpe nata munkayulu wutuma Mose mu balonka ti ngeye nyeki.» <verse eid="MRK 1:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 1:45" />Kansi muntu bewowo bu kayenda, wutona mu mwangisa ku bantu bamvimba musamu wu mutudila. Ni bwabobo, Yesu kedi bwesa kwe yeniki ko ku bantu mu zimbanza. Ku mbazi yi mbanza kedi kwe zakididingi mu bibuka bilembolo ba bantu. Kansi bantu bedi katukanga mu ndambu ka ndambu mu kwiza ku yandi.<verse eid="MRK 1:45" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="MRK 2" />
  <para style="s">Yesu wunyakisa muntu wuna mbwolokoto</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 9:1-8">Mat 9.1-8</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:17-26">Luk 5.17-26</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 2:1" />Mwa bilumbu kwandi bihyoka, Yesu wuvutuka ku mbanza Kapenawumi. Bantu bayuwa ti mu nzo kadi. <verse eid="MRK 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 2:2" />Ni bayiza kutakana babingi, na kusaala dyaka bibuka ko natee ku mbazi yii ha mwelo wu nzo. Yesu ni kedi balonganga Mambu ma Nzambi <verse eid="MRK 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 2:3" />Bantu bayiza ku Yesu na muntu wumosi wubeela mbolokoto, wuba wunangunu ku bakakala baya. <verse eid="MRK 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 2:4" />Kansi balenda ko mu mutudisa natee ha bela Yesu, mu dyambu di mpumbu yi bantu. Ni hahoho, bamakina ku yulu muludi wu nzo, babambula wo nkatika ha bela Yesu, ni bakulumuna mbevo yiba yilambalala ha yulu kipoyi. <verse eid="MRK 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 2:5" />Yesu bu kayena kiminu kyawu, wuta ku muntu wuu na mbolokoto ti: «Mwana ani, masumu maku malemvokolo.» <verse eid="MRK 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 2:6" />Mwa ndambu yi milongisi mi Misiku, miba mizakala hoho, myedi tanga ku nsye mitima myawu ti: <verse eid="MRK 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 2:7" />«Mu dyambu dinki bakala bedidi kana zonzila bobo e? Wuna vweza Nzambi. Nani lendi lemvokila masumu tala ti ka Nzambi yandi bende ko e?» <verse eid="MRK 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 2:8" />Yesu wubakula mu nswalu mabanza mawu ni kabateela ti: «Bila nki ludi na mabanza mabobobo ku nsye mitima myeno e? <verse eid="MRK 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 2:9" />Nkye dyambu dilutidi nayakiyaki mu ta ku muntu wuna mbolokoto: “Masumu maku malemvokolo”, hoti “Telama, bonga kipoyi kyaku na yenda e?” <verse eid="MRK 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 2:10" />Kedika! Mwanki luzaba ti Mwana Muntu wuu na luve lwe lemvokila masumu ha butoto.» Buna wuteela ku muntu wuna mbolokoto ti: <verse eid="MRK 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 2:11" />«Nina kuteela, telama, bonga kipoyi kyaku na vutuka ku nzo aku!» <verse eid="MRK 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 2:12" />Bakala ditumbu telama, wubonga kipoyi kyandi na wuduuka mu nzo ha meso ma bantu bamvimba. Bamvimba bayituku na bakembila Nzambi, ni bata ti: «Yeto twayeni misamu mingitukulu mibubu ko.»<verse eid="MRK 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mbokolo yi Levi mutoti wu mpaku</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 9:9-13">Mat 9.9-13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:27-32">Luk 5.27-32</ref>)</para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 2:13" />Yesu wuvutuka dyaka ha kumu di dyanga di Ngalili. Mpumbu yimvimba yi bantu yiyiza ku yandi, ni kedi balonga. <verse eid="MRK 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 2:14" />Bu kedi hyoka, wuyena Levi, mwana wu Alefe, wuzakala ha kibuka ki bakwe futilanga mpaku. Wumuteela ti: «Ndanda!» Wutelama na wumulanda.<verse eid="MRK 2:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 2:15" />Ku manima, Yesu wuyenda dya mu nzo yi Levi. Mitoti mi mpaku na minsumuki mimingi miba mizakala ha meza na Yesu ha kimosi na milongoki myandi, mu dyambu ti babingi bedi kwe mulandingi. <verse eid="MRK 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 2:16" />Milongisi mi Misiku miba mu kabu di bafalisi, bu miyena ti Yesu wuna dya ha kimosi na minsumuki, mpe na mitoti mi mpaku, ni mita ku milongoki myandi ti: «Bila nki kana diila ha kimosi na mitoti mi mpaku, mpe na minsumuki e?» <verse eid="MRK 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 2:17" />Yesu wubayuwa, wubateela ti: «Ka bantu ba muhinya ko ba na nsatu yi mumbuki, kansi ni bambevo. Nayizidi mu tumisa bantu balunungu ko, kansi minsumuki.»<verse eid="MRK 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu na kumina nsoki</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 9:14-17">Mat 9.14-17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:33-39">Luk 5.33-39</ref>)</para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 2:18" />Kilumbu kimosi, milongoki mi Yoane mumbotiki na bafalisi bamina nsoki. Ni hahoho, bantu bayiza fuudila Yesu ti: «Bila nki milongoki mi Yoane mumbotiki na mi bafalisi mikwe mininanga nsoki, kansi mimyaku mi minanga nsoki ko e?» <verse eid="MRK 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 2:19" />Yesu wubavutudila ti: «Nga yeno luna banzila ti bantu babatumisi ku mukembo wu makwela balendi mina nsoki mu ntangu kikwedi bu kakidi nawu kintwadi e?» Mu ntangu yi kakidi nawu kintwadi, balendi mina nsoki ko. <verse eid="MRK 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 2:20" />Kansi bilumbu byaakwiza bi ba bakatula kikwedi, bilumbu bebyobyo baamina nsoki.<verse eid="MRK 2:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 2:21" />«Kunaani muntu kwe tunganga kitende ki mulele wumoona mu kinkutu kintama. Tala ti kabobo ko, kitende kimona kyaakyakuna ndambu yi kinkutu kintama mpe kukyakuka kwahyoka dyaka bunene. <verse eid="MRK 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 2:22" />Kunaani muntu kwe tulanga vinu dinsonso mu mitumbu mintama. Tala ti kabobo ko, vinu mbo dibula mitumbu na vinu dyaamwangana, mpe mitumbu myaahombila. Kansi bufweni ti vinu dinsonso diba mitumbu mimona.»<verse eid="MRK 2:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu na kilumbu ki saba</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:1-8">Mat 12.1-8</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 6:1-5">Luk 6.1-5</ref>)</para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 2:23" />Mu kilumbu ki saba, Yesu wedi hyokila mu zimfuba zi mbutu zi bele. Milongoki myandi mitona mu konya mbutu bu bedi kwe hyoki. <verse eid="MRK 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 2:24" />Bafalisi bata ku Yesu ti: «Bila nki milongoki myaku mina hiidikila misamu mi bakanikina mu kilumbu ki saba e?» <verse eid="MRK 2:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 2:25" />Yesu wubavutudila ti: «Lutanga ko misamu mihidika Davidi bu kaba na nsatu, yandi mpe na bantu baba nandi kintwadi, baba na bima bye dya ko e? <verse eid="MRK 2:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 2:26" />Wukota mu nzo-Nzambi mu ntangu Abiatali yikaba mfumu nganga-Nzambi. Wudya mampa mahaanu mu minkayulu ku Nzambi, mpeleko Misiku mina lomba ti zinganga-Nzambi kaka zii na luve mu dya mo. Kansi ni kahaana mo mpe ku bantu bandi.» <verse eid="MRK 2:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 2:27" />Mboki Yesu wubwesa bateela dyaka ti: «Bahidika saba mu dyambu di muntu, kansi ka muntu mu dyambu di saba ko. <verse eid="MRK 2:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 2:28" />Ni hahoho, Mwana Muntu kadi Mfumu yi saba.»<verse eid="MRK 2:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="MRK 3" />
  <para style="s">Yesu wunyakisa muntu wuu na kooko kufwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 3:1" />Yesu wukota dyaka mu nzo yi lusambulu yi bayudayo. Mu kati muba na bakala dimosi diba na kooko kufwa. <verse eid="MRK 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 3:2" />Bafalisi bedi keta Yesu mu zaba tala ti lendi munyakisa mu kilumbu ki saba, mu dyambu ti bedi sosa hwahwa dye mufundila. <verse eid="MRK 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 3:3" />Yesu wuta ku bakala diba na kooko kufwa ti: «Telama ha kati di bantu bamvimba.» <verse eid="MRK 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 3:4" />Mboki wubafuula ti: «Mu kilumbu ki saba, nki bifwanakani mu sa e? Kuhidika musamu wumbote hoti musamu wumbi e? Kuvuukisa luzingu lu muntu hoti kumuhonda e?» Kansi baba kwawu na napiii. <verse eid="MRK 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 3:5" />Yesu wubatadila mu mankesi, mpe wuyena kyadi mu dyambu ti mitima myawu miba mingolo. Ni kateela bakala bedyodyo «kalambula kooko kwandi.» Wulambula ko mpe wunyaka. <verse eid="MRK 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 3:6" />Bafalisi bu baduuka ku mbazi, batumbu kutakana na bantu baa mu kabu di Elode mu zaba bwedi balendi hondisila Yesu.<verse eid="MRK 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu wunyakisa mbevo ha kumu di dyanga</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 4:25">Mat 4.25</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 12:15-16">12.15-16</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 6:17-19">Luk 6.17-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 3:7" />Yesu wuyenda na milongoki myandi ku kumu di dyanga di Ngalili. Mpumbu yiyinene yi bantu yimulanda, yifuma ku bizunga bi Ngalili na bi Yuda, <verse eid="MRK 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 3:8" />ku Yelusalemi, ku kizunga ki Idime, ku kizunga kii ku simu di nzadi yi Yolodani na ku bizunga bi mbanza yi Tile na yi Sidoni. Mpumbu beyoyo yiyiza ku Yesu, mu dyambu ti yedi yuwanga mimvimba mi kedi hidikanga. <verse eid="MRK 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 3:9" />Buna Yesu wulomba ku milongoki myandi mi mukubikila mulungu, mwanki mpumbu yi bantu yilembolo mu fyetikisa. <verse eid="MRK 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 3:10" />Mu dyambu ti, wedi nyakisanga bantu babingi, ni hahoho bantu bamvimba bebobo baba na bimbevo, bedi nwanina mu musimba. <verse eid="MRK 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 3:11" />Mpeve zimbi bu ziyena Yesu, zibwa ha ntadisi andi na zedi lokana ti: «Ngeye Mwana Nzambi wudi!» <verse eid="MRK 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 3:12" />Kansi Yesu wedi bakanikina mu ngolo mu lembolo muzabikisa ku bantu.<verse eid="MRK 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu wusoola zintumwa kumi na zole</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:1-4">Mat 10.1-4</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 6:12-16">Luk 6.12-16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 3:13" />Mboki Yesu wutomboka ku yulu mulandu na wutumisa yobobo ba katya mu tumisa, mpe bayiza ba ha ntendo andi. <verse eid="MRK 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 3:14" />Wusoola kumi na bole bakahaana nkumbu yi zintumwa. Wusadila bobo mwanki baba nandi kintwadi na mu batambika mu samuna Musamu Wumbote, <verse eid="MRK 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 3:15" />na lulendo lwe kuma mpeve zimbi. <verse eid="MRK 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 3:16" />Nkumbu zi zintumwa kumi na zole ni ezi: Simoni, wukahaana nkumbu yi Petelo, <verse eid="MRK 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 3:17" />Zaki na mpangi andi Yoane, baala ba Zebedayi, Yesu bakahaana nkumbu yi Bowanenge, mpila mosi ti «baala ba mumbamina», <verse eid="MRK 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 3:18" />Andele, Filipi, Batelemi, Matayi, Toma, Zaki mwana wu Alefe, Tade, Simoni mu-Zeloti, <verse eid="MRK 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 3:19" />mpe na Yuda Isikalyoti, yondowo wuyekola Yesu.<verse eid="MRK 3:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu na Belizebuli</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:22-32">Mat 12.22-32</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 11:14-23">Luk 11.14-23</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 12:10">12.10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 3:20" />Yesu wuyenda ku nzo. Mpumbu yi bantu yikutakana dyaka, mpe Yesu na milongoki myandi bedi baka ntangu ye dya ko. <verse eid="MRK 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 3:21" />Bantu bakanda dyandi bu bayuwa bobo, bayiza mu mubongila mu kingolo, mu dyambu ti, bedi ta ti: «Weka kilahuki!»<verse eid="MRK 3:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 3:22" />Milongisi mi misiku mifuma ku mbanza yi Yelusalemi mita ti: «Belizebuli wuu mu yandi. Mu lulendo lu mfumu yi mpeve zimbi kana kumina mpeve zimbi!» <verse eid="MRK 3:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 3:23" />Buna Yesu wubatumisa na wubateela kingana eki: «Bwedi Satana kalendi kumina dyaka satana e? <verse eid="MRK 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 3:24" />Tala ti bantu bakintinu kimosi bakabukidi yawu na yawu, kintinu bekyokyo kilendi tatamana mu zingila ko, <verse eid="MRK 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 3:25" />tala ti bantu bakanda dimosi bakabukidi yawu na yawu, kanda bedyodyo dilendi tatamana mu zingila ko. <verse eid="MRK 3:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 3:26" />Tala ti Satana wuna kinwanisa yandi bende, mpe kabukidi, kalendi tatamana mu zingila ko, mpe lulendo lwandi lumanisi.<verse eid="MRK 3:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 3:27" />Kansi, kunaani muntu wulendi kota mu nzo yi muntu wuu na ngolo mu muzika mvwilu andi yimvimba, tala ti ka mubindikidi ntete misinga ko. Ni bwabobo kaamuzikila mvwilu yi mu nzo andi. <verse eid="MRK 3:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 3:28" />Kedika nina luteela wo: Baalemvokila masumu mamvimba ku bantu, na momo mpe me safudila Nzambi. <verse eid="MRK 3:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 3:29" />Kansi yondowo waasafula Mpeve Yilongo, kaatambula ndemvokolo ko: siidi disumu dikwe sikilanga mimvu ka mimvu.»<verse eid="MRK 3:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 3:30" />Yesu wuzonzila bobo, bu bata ti: «Mpeve yimbi yii nandi!»<verse eid="MRK 3:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ngudi na mpangi zi Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:46-50">Mat 12.46-50</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:19-21">Luk 8.19-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 3:31" />Ngudi andi yiyiza na zimpangi zandi zi babakala, batelama ha mbazi na batambika muntu mu kwe tumisa Yesu. <verse eid="MRK 3:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 3:32" />Mpumbu yi bantu yimuzungidila yiba yizakala na bamuteela ti: «Ngudi aku, na mpangi zaku zi babakala [na bibusi byaku] ha mbazi badi batelama, mpe bana kusosa.» <verse eid="MRK 3:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 3:33" />Kansi Yesu wubavutudila ti: «Nani wuu ngudi ani, mpe banani baa zimpangi zani e?» <verse eid="MRK 3:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 3:34" />Wuzungisa meso ku bantu baba bazakala bamuzungidila, mpe wuta ti: «Taleeno ngudi ani na zimpangi zani! <verse eid="MRK 3:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 3:35" />Mu dyambu ti, yondowo kwe sadilanga luzolo lu Nzambi, yandi ni mpangi ani, kibusi kyani na ngudi ani.»<verse eid="MRK 3:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="MRK 4" />
  <para style="s">Kingana ki kisadi ki mfuba</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:1-9">Mat 13.1-9</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:4-8">Luk 8.4-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 4:1" />Yesu wutona dyaka mu longa ha kumu di dyanga. Mpumbu yi bantu yiyiza kutakana ha kabela. Yiba nkatika yiyingi ni kayenda kota mu mulungu na wuzakala. Mpe mpumbu yimvimba yi bantu yiba ha kumu di dyanga <verse eid="MRK 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 4:2" />Wedi balonga misamu mimingi mu bingana na mundongosolo andi wedi bateelanga ti: <verse eid="MRK 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 4:3" />«Yuweeno! Kisadi kimfuba kiyenda mu kwe mwanga nswanga. <verse eid="MRK 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 4:4" />Bu kedi kwe mwangi nswanga, ndambu yi nswanga yibwa ha sambu di nzila: banuni bayiza na badya yo. <verse eid="MRK 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 4:5" />Ndambu yihiika yibwa ha butoto buu na matadi na butoto buba bubwingi ko. Nswanga yi tumbu mena, mu dyambu ti butoto buba bubwingi ko. <verse eid="MRK 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 4:6" />Kansi mwini bu wuteka, wuyoka na wuyumisa yo mu dyambu ti yiba na myanzi ko. <verse eid="MRK 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 4:7" />Na ndambu yihiika yibwa ha kati di bititi binsende. Bititi binsende bikula na bifyetikisa yo na yibuta nakani mbutu ko. <verse eid="MRK 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 4:8" />Kansi zihiika zibwa ha butoto bumbote, mwa miti mimena, mikula mpe mibuta mbutu mu bikanka: kimosi makumatatu (30) ma mbutu, kihiika makumasambanu (60) na kihiika dyaka nkama (100).» <verse eid="MRK 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 4:9" />Na Yesu wuta ti: «Wonso wuu na makutu mu yuwa, bika kayuwa!»<verse eid="MRK 4:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu wusadila bingana</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:10-17">Mat 13.10-17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:9-10">Luk 8.9-10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 4:10" />Mukangu bu wuyenda, yobobo bazungidila Yesu na milongoki kumi na myole bamufuula mu dyambu di kingana bekyokyo. <verse eid="MRK 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 4:11" />Wubavutudila ti: «Yeno baluhaana luve mu zaba mansweki ma kimfumu ki mazulu, kansi yawu baa ku mbazi bafweti bateela myo mu bingana, <verse eid="MRK 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 4:12" />mu dyambu ti</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 4:12">yawu bana tala, kansi bana yena kima ko,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 4:12">mboki bana yuwa, kansi bana bakula nakani kima kimosi ko.»</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 4:12">Mwanki balembolo vilula madyela, mpe Nzambi kalembolo balemvokila.<verse eid="MRK 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mbangudulu yi kingana yi kisadi ki mfuba</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:18-23">Mat 13.18-23</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:11-15">Luk 8.11-15</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 4:13" />Mboki Yesu wubateela ti: «Tala ti lubakudi kingana bekiki ko, bwedi lwaabakudila bingana bimvimba bihiika e? <verse eid="MRK 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 4:14" />Kisadi ki mfuba ni yondowo wuna kwe mwangisi Mambu ma Nzambi. <verse eid="MRK 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 4:15" />Bantu bahiika baa bonso sambu di nzila di tambudi Mambu ma Nzambi. Bu bayudi mo, Satana wizidi na wubakatudi Mambu ma Nzambi ma bayudi. <verse eid="MRK 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 4:16" />Bantu bahiika baa bonso butoto bu matadi bu tambudi Mambu ma Nzambi: bu bayudi Mambu ma Nzambi, bakwe tumbu tambulanga mo mu kyese. <verse eid="MRK 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 4:17" />Kansi malendi mena myanzi mu yawu ko, bakwe kwikilanga mu mwa ntangu yifyoti. Mboki, misamu mi mpasi hoti mfyetokoso bu zitudidi mu dyambu di Mambu ma Nzambi, bakwe bwisanga kiminu. <verse eid="MRK 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 4:18" />Bahiika mpe baa bonso bititi binsende bitambudi Mambu ma Nzambi: bakwe yuwanga Mambu ma Nzambi, <verse eid="MRK 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 4:19" />kansi nsatu zi nza, mpukumunu yi bimvwama na mpwila zi mumpila mu mpila, bu zikotididi mu yawu, zikwe fyetikisanga Mambu ma Nzambi na malendi buta mimbutu mu yawu ko. <verse eid="MRK 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 4:20" />Bahiika dyaka baa bonso butoto bumbote butambudi Mambu ma Nzambi: bakwe yuwanga Mambu ma Nzambi, bakwe tambulanga mo mpe makwe butanga mbutu mu bikanka, kimosi makumatatu (30), kihiika makumasambanu (60) na kihiika dyaka nkama (100).»<verse eid="MRK 4:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kingana ki mwinda na kitezolo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 8:16-18">Luk 8.16-18</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 4:21" />Yesu wubateela dyaka ti: «Nganunu kuu na muntu wulendi twaala mwinda mu tuula wo ku nsye kisiku hoti katuula wo ku nsye mbuka e? Bwedi, ka mu tuula wo ha yulu kikebolo ki mwinda ko e? <verse eid="MRK 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 4:22" />Mu dyambu ti misamu mimvimba mii miswama myaayenika, mpe mansweki mamvimba maazabakana mu mwini ngemba. <verse eid="MRK 4:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 4:23" />Wonso wuu na makutu mu yuwa, bika kayuwa!»<verse eid="MRK 4:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 4:24" />Yesu wubateela dyaka ti: «lwengeeno kweno mu misamu mi luna kwe yuwi! Kitezo ki lukwe tezilanga kyakyokyo mpe baalutezila, mpe baalubwesa dyaka kilutidi. <verse eid="MRK 4:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 4:25" />Mu dyambu ti baahaana ku yondowo wuu na kima, mbo bamubwesa kihiika, kansi ku yondowo wulembolo ba na kima, mbo bamukatula mpe kima kyo kii nandi.»<verse eid="MRK 4:25" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kingana ki nswanga yikwe menanga yawu bende</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 4:26" />Yesu wubateela dyaka ti: «Tala nki bifwanakani na Kimfumu ki Nzambi. Kimfumu ki Nzambi kifwanakani na muntu mwengi nswanga mu mfuba andi. <verse eid="MRK 4:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 4:27" />Mpimpa na mwini, ni kaba wulambalala hoti ni kaba wutemona, nswanga yamena, mpe yakula yawu bende, kansi kana zaba ko bwedi yina kudila. <verse eid="MRK 4:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 4:28" />Butoto bwabende bukwe menisanga mbutu: hantete muti, mboki bikanka, mpe mu bikanka mbutu ziyedidi. <verse eid="MRK 4:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 4:29" />Mbutu bu zatumbu yela, babongidi kisalulu ki bakwe hedilanga mbutu, mu dyambu ti ntangu yi ngyonzokolo yifweni.»<verse eid="MRK 4:29" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kingana ki nswanga yi mutaade</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:31-32">Mat 13.31-32</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 13:34">34</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 13:18-19">Luk 13.18-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 4:30" />Yesu wuta dyaka ti: «Na nkye kima twaafwanikisa Kimfumu ki Nzambi e? Na mu nkye kingana twaafwanikisa kyo e? <verse eid="MRK 4:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 4:31" />Kifwanakani na nswanga yi muti wu nkumbu mutaade, bu bakunini yo, ni nswanga yivudidi bukeke mu nswanga zimvimba zi ha butoto. <verse eid="MRK 4:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 4:32" />Kansi bu bakunini yo, bu yaamena, yaavula bunene na mwa miti mimvimba mi mfuba. Yaaduukisa bintala bivudidi bunene mpe banuni baakwiza tunga mazanza ku nsye mposi andi.» <verse eid="MRK 4:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 4:33" />Yesu wusadila bingana bibingi bibobo mu ndongosolo andi. Yandi wusadila bobo bonso buba mpisulu yi yobobo bedi mu yuwanga. <verse eid="MRK 4:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 4:34" />Kabazonzila wulembolo sadila bingana ko, kansi bu kedi saalanga na milongoki myandi, wedi babangudilanga myo mimvimba.<verse eid="MRK 4:34" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu wudingimisa kitembo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:23-27">Mat 8.23-27</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:22-25">Luk 8.22-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 4:35" />Mu nkokila yi kilumbu bekyokyo kwandi, Yesu wuteela milongi myandi ti: «Tusabukeeno ku simu dikaka di dyanga.» <verse eid="MRK 4:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 4:36" />Bu basala sisa mpumbu yi bantu, milongoki mimunatina mu mulungu wu kaba, na milungu mihiika miba nandi hoho. <verse eid="MRK 4:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 4:37" />Mboki kitembo kingolo kikukula mu dyanga, na bipo bimamba byedi bwanga mu mulungu mpe mulungu wutona mu teboka. <verse eid="MRK 4:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 4:38" />Kansi Yesu wubwa tolo ku manima ma mulungu na mutu andi wuba ha yulu mfika. Milongoki myandi mimusungika na mimuteela ti: «Mulongisi, tuna saka fwa! Mpe wuna kukwamisa ko e?» <verse eid="MRK 4:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 4:39" />Yesu wusungama, wubamina kitembo na wuta ku mamba ma dyanga ti: «Dingama! Huza napii!» Kitembo kidingama na kizunu kikinene kivutuka. <verse eid="MRK 4:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 4:40" />Yesu wuta ku milongoki ti: «Nki luna yenina bunkuta e? Bwedi lulembolo beela na kiminu e?» <verse eid="MRK 4:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 4:41" />Kansi milongoki miyena bunkuta bubwingi na myedi kifuulasananga yawu na yawu ti: «Muntu bewuwu nani kadi, mwanki kitembo na mamba mpe ma mubu bimutumimina e?»<verse eid="MRK 4:41" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="MRK 5" />
  <para style="s">Yesu wunyakisa muntu wuba na mpeve zimbi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:28-34">Mat 8.28-34</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:26-39">Luk 8.26-39</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 5:1" />Batula ku simu di kaka di dyanga di Ngalili, ku kizunga ki bisi-Ngelaseni. <verse eid="MRK 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 5:2" />Yesu bu katotoka mu mulungu, bakala dimosi ditumbu duuka ku kati di ndyamu na diyiza mubwana. Bakala bedyodyo diba dilwatu mu mpeve yimbi <verse eid="MRK 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 5:3" />Yandi ku ndyamu kedi zakidilanga na kuba nakani muntu ko wedi lendanga mu mubindika misinga, kaati ni miba misinga mi bisengo, <verse eid="MRK 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 5:4" />mu dyambu ti wedi vula banga wubinduku mu bisengo mu malu na mu misinga mi bisengo mu moko, kansi wedi zenganga misinga mi bisengo na wedi tabulanga bisengo. Mpe kuba nakani muntu ko wuba na ngolo mu mulemvola. <verse eid="MRK 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 5:5" />Ntangu zimvimba mpimpa na mwinu wedi kwe yimingi ku ndyamu na ku yulu milandu, mpe wedi kwe bulaningi na wedi kwe kilwekisingi mu matadi. <verse eid="MRK 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 5:6" />Bu kayena Yesu kitatu, wunooka na wufukama ha ntadisi andi <verse eid="MRK 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 5:7" />na wulooka mu ngolo ti: «Yesu, Mwana wu Nzambi Yihyokidi Kuzangama, nkye dyambu ngeye na meno e? Mulemvo aku mu nkumbu yi Nzambi, kunkwamisandi ko!» <verse eid="MRK 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 5:8" />Mu dyambu ti Yesu wedi muteela ti: «Mpeve yimbi totoka mu nitu yi muntu bewuwu!» <verse eid="MRK 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 5:9" />Yesu wumufuula ti: «Nkumbu aku nani e?» Yandi wuvutula ti: «Nkumbu ani “Babingi”, mu dyambu ti babingi tudi.» <verse eid="MRK 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 5:10" />Buna yibombidila Yesu bubwingi mu lembolo batambika ku kizunga kihiika.<verse eid="MRK 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 5:11" />Kuba na kamba di zingulu dyedi kwe sosi bye dya mu mulandu. <verse eid="MRK 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 5:12" />Na mpeve zimbi zimvimba zibombidila Yesu ti: «Tutambika kweto mu zingulu bezozo, mwanki tukota mu yawu!» <verse eid="MRK 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 5:13" />Yesu wubahaana luve. Mpeve zimbi zitotoka mu bakala na ziyenda kota mu zingulu. Kamba bedyodyo di zingulu diba kampe mafunda mole (2000), dilundumuka tuuka ku yulu mulandu natee ziyenda bwa mu dyanga na zimana dyama. <verse eid="MRK 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 5:14" />Minkengi mi zingulu bawoka na bayenda mwangisa nsangu mu mbanza na mu mwa zinzo zi mimvungi. Bantu bayenda mu tala misamu bwedi mihyokila. <verse eid="MRK 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 5:15" />Batula ha beela Yesu, bayena muntu bewowo wuba wulwatu ku mpeve zimbi zizingi: wuba wuzakala, wulwata binkutu na kimuntu kyandi kisikama. Mpe bunkuta bubabaka. <verse eid="MRK 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 5:16" />Yobobo bayena mimvimba, babayadila mpolo zi misamu mitudila muntu wuba wulwatu ku mpeve zimbi na ku zingulu. <verse eid="MRK 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 5:17" />Ni hahoho, batona mu bombidila Yesu kakatuka mu kizunga kyawu. <verse eid="MRK 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 5:18" />Yesu bu kedi kota mu mulungu, muntu wuba wulwatu ku mpeve zimbi wumubombidila kenda nandi. <verse eid="MRK 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 5:19" />Yesu kamuhaanina dyo luve ko, kansi wumuteela ti: «Yenda ku nzo aku, ku kanda dyaku na bateela mimvimba Mfumu mi kakuhidikidi, na bwedi kakufwididi nkenda.» <verse eid="MRK 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 5:20" />Wuyenda, na wutona mu mwangisa nsangu mu kizunga ki Dekapoli mu mimvimba mi muhidikila Yesu na bamvimba bayituku bubwingi.<verse eid="MRK 5:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu wunyakisa mukento na wufulukisa mwana wu Yayilo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 9:18-26">Mat 9.18-26</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:40-56">Luk 8.40-56</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 5:21" />Yesu wuvutuka ku simu dihiika mu mulungu. Mpumbu yi bantu yikutakana na yimuzungidila ha kumu di mamba. <verse eid="MRK 5:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 5:22" />Buna wumosi mu zimfumu yi nzo yi lusambulu yi Bayudayo, nkumbu andi Yayilo, wuyiza. Bu kayena Yesu, wubwa ha malu mandi <verse eid="MRK 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 5:23" />na wumubombidila bubwingi ti: mwana ani wu mukento weka lukufi mu fwa. Yiza wumutentika moko, mwanki kavuuka na kaba wumoyo. <verse eid="MRK 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 5:24" />Yesu wuyenda nandi. Mpumbu yi bantu yedi kwe mulandi na yedi kwe mufyetikisi mu ndambu ka ndambu.<verse eid="MRK 5:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 5:25" />Kuba na mukento wumosi wuba na kimbevo kye kwe totokingi menga, kizingila mvula kumi na zole (12). <verse eid="MRK 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 5:26" />Wutoma yena mpasi zizingi mu moko ma mimbuki mimingi. Wumanisa mvwilu andi yimvimba yiba nandi, yandi kabaka mpe lunyakusu ko, kansi mpasi zihyoka dyaka kitezo. <verse eid="MRK 5:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 5:27" />Wuyuwa bu bedi zonzilanga Yesu. Wuyizila ki manima ha kati di mpumbu yi bantu na wusimba kinkutu kyandi. <verse eid="MRK 5:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 5:28" />Mu dyambu wuyindula ti: «Namana simba kwandi kinkutu kyandi, naanyaka!» <verse eid="MRK 5:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 5:29" />Hansi na nsi, menga ma tumbu kangama na wuzaba mu nitu andi ti nyeki mu mpasi zandi.<verse eid="MRK 5:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 5:30" />Mu kilokola bekyokyo kwandi, Yesu wutumbu zaba ti lulendo luduuka mu kati dyandi. Wubangumuka ku mpumbu yi bantu na wufuula: «Nani simbidi binkutu byani e?» <verse eid="MRK 5:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 5:31" />Milongoki myandi mimuvutudila ti: «Wuna yena mpumbu yi bantu yina kwe kufyetikisi mu ndambu ka ndambu, kadi wuna fuula ti: “Nani wunsimbidi e?”» <verse eid="MRK 5:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 5:32" />Kansi Yesu wutala bamuzungidila mu zaba yondowo wusa bobo. <verse eid="MRK 5:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 5:33" />Mukento bewowo wedi tekita mu bunkuta, mu dyambu ti wuzaba mi mutudila. Wuyiza bwa ha malu ma Yesu na wumuteela kikedika kimvimba. <verse eid="MRK 5:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 5:34" />Buna Yesu wumuteela ti: «Mwana ani, kiminu kyaku kikuvuukisi, yenda mu kiyenge na bika wunyaka mu kimbevo kyaku.»<verse eid="MRK 5:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 5:35" />Bu kedi tatamana mu zonza, bantu bayiza bafuma ku nzo yi mfumu yi nzo yi lusambulu yi Bayudayo na bamuteela ti: «Mwana aku wu mukento wufwidi. Bila nki wuna kwamisina dyaka Mulongisi e?» <verse eid="MRK 5:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 5:36" />Kansi Yesu bu katumbu yuwa misamu bemyomyo, wuta ku mfumu yi nzo yi lusambulu yi Bayudayo ti: «Kubandi na bunkuta, sa kwandi kiminu.» <verse eid="MRK 5:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 5:37" />Kabika nakani muntu wumosi kamulanda ko, kansi Petelo kwandi, Zaki na Yoane mpangi yi Zaki. <verse eid="MRK 5:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 5:38" />Batula ku nzo yi mfumu yi nzo yi lusambulu yi Bayudayo, Yesu wuyena bantu baba mutela-mutela mpe bedi dila na bedi bulana. <verse eid="MRK 5:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 5:39" />Wukota na wubateela ti: «Bila nki ludi mutela-mutela na luna didila e? Mwana wufwidi ko, kansi tolo kwandi wubwidi.» <verse eid="MRK 5:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 5:40" />Kansi, ni bamusehila. Buna wukuma bamvimba ku mbazi, wubonga nandi ngudi na tata yi mwana na milongoki myandi mya mitatu, mboki bakota mu kihinga kiba mwana. <verse eid="MRK 5:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 5:41" />Yesu wusimba kooko ku mwana na wumuteela ti: «Talita kumi!» Bangundulu ti: «Mwana ndumba, nina kuteela, telama!» <verse eid="MRK 5:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 5:42" />Mwana ndumba wutumbu telama na wutona mu kwe yendi, mu dyambu ti wuba na mvula kumi na zole (12). Bamvimba bayituku bubwingi. <verse eid="MRK 5:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 5:43" />Kansi Yesu wubakanikina balembolo we ta ku muntu. Mpe wubateela bamuhaana bindya.<verse eid="MRK 5:43" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="MRK 6" />
  <para style="s">Yesu ba mukwikila ku Nazaleti ko</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:53-58">Mat 13.53-58</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:16-30">Luk 4.16-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 6:1" />Yesu wukatuka koko mpe wuyenda ku mbanza yi kakudila. Milongoki myandi mi mulanda. <verse eid="MRK 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 6:2" />Mu kilumbu ki saba, wedi longa mu kati di nzo yi lusambulu yi Bayudayo. Bantu babingi bedi mu yuwa, bayituku na bata ti: «Kwedi kabakidi misamu bemimi e? Nkye mpila ndwenga bezozo bamuheeni e? Bwedi bimangu bebibi bilendi hidimina mu moko mandi e? <verse eid="MRK 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 6:3" />Ka ni kisadi ki mabaya ko, ka ni mwana Maliya ko, mpangi yi Zaki, Yose, Simoni na Yude e? Bibusi byandi, bikwe banga neto ko e?» Myamyomyo myedi bakakidila mu kwikila mu yandi. <verse eid="MRK 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 6:4" />Yesu wubateela ti: «Bakwe zitisanga mu Mumbikudi mu nsi andi ko, mu kanda dyandi ko na mu nzo andi ko.» <verse eid="MRK 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 6:5" />Kasa nakani kimangu hoho ko, tala ti ka ni mwa ndambu yi zimbevo zikanyakisa bu kabatentika moko. <verse eid="MRK 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 6:6" />Wutoma yituku mu dyambu ti baba na lukwikulu ko.</para>
  <para style="s" vid="MRK 6:6">Kisalu tambikidi milongoki kumi na myole</para>
  <para style="r" vid="MRK 6:6">(<ref loc="MAT 10:5-15">Mat 10.5-15</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:1-6">Luk 9.1-6</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 6:6">Yesu wedi kwe zyeti mu mabwala ma kinzungidila mu kwe longi.<verse eid="MRK 6:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 6:7" />Yesu wutumisa milongoki kumi na myole (12) na wutona mu batambika bole-bole. Wubahaana lulendo mu zimpeve zimbi. <verse eid="MRK 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 6:8" />Wubahaana ndwengosolo ezi: «Ka lunatandi kima mu nzyetolo eno ko, kansi muti wumosi kaka, ka dimpa ko, ka nkutu ko, mpe ka mbongo mu musinga wu luketo ko. <verse eid="MRK 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 6:9" />Lwaateeno nsampatu, kansi ka lunatandi binkutu byole ko.» <verse eid="MRK 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 6:10" />Mboki wubateela dyaka ti: «Tala ti baalutambula mu nzo, beeno momo natee kilumbu ki lwaakwenda. <verse eid="MRK 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 6:11" />Tala ti bantu ba mbanza yimosi balutambudi ko mpe baluyuwidi ko, duukeeno momo na kubuleeno fundu-fundu di bitambi byeno, kyo kyaaba kimbangi ku yawu.»<verse eid="MRK 6:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 6:12" />Milongoki miyenda mu kwe samuna ku bantu bavilula madyela. <verse eid="MRK 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 6:13" />Bedi kwe kumi mpeve zimbi zizingi na bedi kwe kusi mafuta ku zimbevo zizingi, mpe bedi banyakisa.<verse eid="MRK 6:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lufwa lu Yoane Mumbotiki</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 14:1-12">Mat 14.1-12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:7-9">Luk 9.7-9</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 6:14" />Ntinu Elode wuyuwa bu bedi zonzilanga Yesu, mu dyambu ti nkumbu andi yiyenda kikumu. Wuta ti: «Ni Yoane Mumbotiki wufulukidi mu bafwa! Ni hahoho kaa na lulendo mu sa bimangu.» <verse eid="MRK 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 6:15" />Bahiika ti: «Ni Eliya.» Bahiika dyaka ti: «Mumbikudi wumosi bonso mimbikudi mintama.» <verse eid="MRK 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 6:16" />Kansi ntinu Elode bu kayuwa bobo, wuta ti: «Ni Yoane wu nazengisa mutu, ni yandi fulukidi mu bafwa!»<verse eid="MRK 6:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 6:17" />Mu dyambu ti, ni yandi Elode wuhaana luve bakanga Yoane na bamutuula mu boloko wubinduku mu misinga mi bisengo. Wusa bobo mu dyambu di Elodiade, mukento wu mpangi andi Filipi, wu kakwela. <verse eid="MRK 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 6:18" />Mu dyambu ti Yoane wuteela Elode ti: «Wuu na luve ko mukwela mukento wu mpangi aku!» <verse eid="MRK 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 6:19" />Elodiade wutwika Yoane kibelo, ni kedi sosanga mu muhondisa. Kansi kedi lendanga ko, <verse eid="MRK 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 6:20" />mu dyambu ti Elode wedi yenanga Yoane bunkuta, muntu wulunungu na wulongo kaba, ni hahoho kedi kwe mukebididingi. Bu kedi muyuwanga, yandi wedi kikwamisanga bubwingi, mpeleko wedi tyanga mu muyuwa. <verse eid="MRK 6:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 6:21" />Buna Elodiade wubaka hwakisa mu kilumbu ki mukembo wu mbutukulu yi Elode. Elode wuhidikisa ndambisa, mu dyambu di zimfumu zi luyalu, mfumu zi zimbulu-mbulu na bantu babuzitu ba bisi-Ngalili. <verse eid="MRK 6:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 6:22" />Mwana wu Elodiade wu mukento wukota na wukina, wutoma yangidika Elode na bantu ba katumisa ku mukembo andi. Buna ntinu wuta ku ndumba ti: «Ndomba kyonso-kyonso kima ki wutiidi, mpe kya nina kuhaana.» <verse eid="MRK 6:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 6:23" />Mpe wudya ndefi ti: «Nina kuhaana kyonso-kyonso kima ki waandomba, ni kiba ndambu yi nsi yi kimfumu kyani.» <verse eid="MRK 6:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 6:24" />Mwana ndumba wuduuka na wuteela wo ngudi andi: «Nki nalendi lomba e?» Ngudi andi wumuvutudila ti: «Mutu wu Yoane Mumbotiki.» <verse eid="MRK 6:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 6:25" />Wutumbu vutuka mu muswalu ku ntinu na wumulomba ti: «Ntiidi ti wumpana, butusidi bubu, mutu wu Yoane Mumbotiki mu ndonga!» <verse eid="MRK 6:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 6:26" />Ntinu wukota mu kyadi, kansi kalendi bisa ko, mu dyambu di ndefi yi kadya ha ntadisi yi bantu ba katumisa. <verse eid="MRK 6:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 6:27" />Ntinu wutumbu tambika mbulu-mbulu yimosi na lutumu lwe nata mutu wu Yoane Mumbotiki. Mbulu-mbulu yiyenda tabula mutu wu Yoane mu boloko. <verse eid="MRK 6:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 6:28" />Mboki wutwala mutu mu ndonga, na wuhaana wo ku mwana ndumba, mpe yandi wuhaana wo ku ngudi andi. <verse eid="MRK 6:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 6:29" />Milongoki mi Yoane bu bayuwa musamu bewowo, bayiza bonga nitu andi na batuula yo mu ndyamu.<verse eid="MRK 6:29" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu wudikila mafunda matanu ma babakala</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 14:13-21">Mat 14.13-21</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:10-17">Luk 9.10-17</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 6:1-14">Yoa 6.1-14</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 6:30" />Zintumwa zikutakana ku Yesu na zimuyadila mimvimba mi bahidika, mpe mi balonga. <verse eid="MRK 6:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 6:31" />Yesu wubateela ti: «Yizeeno ha luhengo ha kibuka ki yeto hiika na humeeno mwa ndambu.» Mu dyambu ti bantu bedi kwendanga na vutukanga, mpe baba nakani ntangu ye dya ko. <verse eid="MRK 6:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 6:32" />Bakota mu mulungu, bayenda ha luhengo ha kibuka kiyawu hiika. <verse eid="MRK 6:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 6:33" />Kansi bantu babingi babayena bu bedi kwenda, mpe babakula kibuka ki bedi kwenda. Buna bafuma mu zimbanza zimvimba zi kizunga bayiza mu ntiinu na batula mu malu ha kibuka bekyokyo, tekila Yesu na milongoki myandi batula.<verse eid="MRK 6:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 6:34" />Bu katotoka mu mulungu, Yesu wuyena mpumbu yi bantu yiyinene na wubafwila nkenda, mu dyambu ti baba bonso mameme malembolo ba na mumvungi. Mboki, wubalonga misamu mimingi. <verse eid="MRK 6:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 6:35" />Ntangu bu yikibeela kukula, milongoki myandi mifinama ha kabeela na mimuteela ti: «Bwisi bweka kukula, mboki kibuka kitudi kii na kima ko. <verse eid="MRK 6:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 6:36" />Vutula bantu bamvimba mwanki benda mu mabwala maa bela-bela na mwa zinzo zi mimvungi, basumba bye dya.» <verse eid="MRK 6:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 6:37" />Yesu wubavutudila ti: «Bahaaneeno yebende bindya!» Kansi bamuteela ti: «Tusumba mampa ma nkama nzole zi mbongo zi bisengo na tubahaana badya e?» <verse eid="MRK 6:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 6:38" />Yesu wubateela ti: «Mampa makwa ma neeno e? Yendeeno lutala» Bayenda tala na bavutula ti: «Tuu na mampa matanu na mbizi zole.» <verse eid="MRK 6:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 6:39" />Buna, Yesu wubatuma mu bazakisa bamvimba ha yulu bititi bimamba mu kabu-kabu . <verse eid="MRK 6:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 6:40" />Bantu bazakala mu makabu ma bantu nkama (100) mpe makabu ma bantu makumatanu (50). <verse eid="MRK 6:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 6:41" />Wubonga mampa ma matanu na mbizi za zizole, wusendola meso ku yulu ni kasakumuna byo. Mboki wubukuna mampa ni kahaana mo ku milongoki mwanki bakabula ku mpumbu yi bantu. Wukabula mpe mbizi za zizole ku yawu bamvimba. <verse eid="MRK 6:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 6:42" />Bamvimba badya na bayukuta. <verse eid="MRK 6:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 6:43" />Batota mikuta kumi na myole mifuluka mu bibuku bi mampa na mbizi zisadila. <verse eid="MRK 6:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 6:44" />Yobobo badya, baba mafunda matanu ma babakala (5000).<verse eid="MRK 6:44" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu wudyata ha mukanda mamba</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 14:22-33">Mat 14.22-33</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 6:15-21">Yoa 6.15-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 6:45" />Ku manima, Yesu wutumbu tuma milongoki myandi bakota mu mulungu na bamutekidila ku simu dihiika, ku ndambusu yi mbanza yi Betesayida, mu ntangu yi kedi vutula yandi bende mpumbu yi bantu. <verse eid="MRK 6:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 6:46" />Bu kamana bavutula, wutomboka ha yulu mulandu mu sambila. <verse eid="MRK 6:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 6:47" />Bwisi bu buyila, mulungu wuba ha kati-kati di dyanga na Yesu wuba yandi hika ku simu. <verse eid="MRK 6:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MRK 6:48" />Wuyena ti milongoki myandi mi ba na mpasi mu kwe nati mulungu, mu dyambu di kitembo kingolo kibabwana. Mu minkyelo mi bwisi, Yesu wuyenda ku ndambusu yi bela milongoki myandi na wedi kwe dyati ha mukanda mamba, mpe wusosa mu bahyoka. <verse eid="MRK 6:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MRK 6:49" />Bu bamuyena wuna kwe dyati ha mukanda mamba ma dyanga, babanzila ti mukuyu, mpe yawu babulana. <verse eid="MRK 6:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MRK 6:50" />Mu dyambu ti bamvimba bedi muyena, mpe baba na bunkuta. Kansi Yesu wutumbu bateela ti: «Lwaateeno kibakala! Meno kwani, lubandi na bunkuta ko!» <verse eid="MRK 6:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="MRK 6:51" />Mboki wukota mu mulungu ha babeela, kitembo kidingama. Bayituku nkatika bubwingi, <verse eid="MRK 6:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="MRK 6:52" />mu dyambu ti babakula nakani kima ko mu kimangu ki mampa, kadi mitima myawu miba mikangama.<verse eid="MRK 6:52" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu wunyakisa zimbevo ku Ngenezaleti</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 14:34-36">Mat 14.34-36</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="MRK 6:53" />Bu bamana sabuka, batula ha kumu ku kizunga ki Ngenezaleti, mpe basikika mulungu. <verse eid="MRK 6:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="MRK 6:54" />Bu katotoka mu mulungu, bantu batumbu bakula Yesu. <verse eid="MRK 6:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="MRK 6:55" />Bantu banooka ntiinu ku kizunga kimvimba, na batona mu mutwadila zimbevo ha yulu bipoyi, ku kyonso kibuka ki bedi yuwanga ti: «Yesu wuu koko!» <verse eid="MRK 6:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="MRK 6:56" />Kuma kumvimba ku kedi kwe yendi, mu mabwala, mu zimbanza hoti mu mwa zinzo zi mimvungi, batuula zimbevo ha byanzala, bedi mubombidilanga mwanki basimba kwandi mu sukina kinkutu kyandi. Bantu bamvimba basimba kyo, banyaka.<verse eid="MRK 6:56" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="MRK 7" />
  <para style="s">Yesu na kinkulu ki Bayudayo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 15:1-20">Mat 15.1-20</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 7:1" />Bafalisi na mwa ndambu yi milongisi mi Misiku bafuma ku mbanza Yelusalemi, bayiza kutakana ha ba Yesu. <verse eid="MRK 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 7:2" />Bayena mwa ndambu yi milongoki myedi dyanga na moko mamvindu, mpila mosi malembolo sukulu. <verse eid="MRK 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 7:3" />Mu dyambu ti, Bafalisi na Bayudayo bamvimba tekila badya bafweti teka sukula moko bumbote, bonso buu kinkulu ki zinkaka zawu <verse eid="MRK 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 7:4" />bu bafumini ha kyanzala, balendi dya ko tala ti bakivedisi ko. Mpe bakwe toma vuminanga mimingi mihiika mi kinkulu kyawu bonso kusukula mbungu, masanga, bisiku bi bisengo mpe [bizakudulu bye dila].<verse eid="MRK 7:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 7:5" />Buna Bafalisi na milongisi mi Misiku bafuula Yesu ti: «Bila nki milongoki myaku mikwe lembolo vumininanga kinkulu ki zinkaka zeto, kansi bakwe dyanga na moko mamvindu e?» <verse eid="MRK 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 7:6" />Yesu wubavutudila ti: «Bantu ba diisu ku nsye lukaya ludi, ni mu dyambu dyeno mumbikudi Yesaya kabikula bu kata ti:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 7:6">“Mu bikoba kwandi bantu bebaba bakwe nzitisilanga ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 7:6">kansi mitima myawu mii mitatuka na meno.<verse eid="MRK 7:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 7:7" />Mumpamba bakwe nzitisilanga,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 7:7">Mu dyambu ti Misiku mi bakwe longanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MRK 7:7">ntumunu zi bantu kwandi zidi.”<verse eid="MRK 7:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 7:8" />Lukwe loosanga ntumunu zi Nzambi mpe lukwe vuminanga kinkulu ki bantu.» <verse eid="MRK 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 7:9" />Yesu wubateela dyaka ti: «Lukwe loosanga ntumunu zi Nzambi mwanki luvumina kinkulu kyeno. <verse eid="MRK 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 7:10" />Mu dyambu ti Mose wuta ti: “Vumina tata aku na ngudi aku”, mpe “Yondowo singidi tata andi hoti ngudi andi bafweti mu honda.” <verse eid="MRK 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 7:11" />Kadi yeno lukwe tanga ti: “Tala ti muntu teedi ku tata andi hoti ku ngudi andi ti: Kima ki naketi kuhaana mu kusadisa kidi Kolobani”, mpila mosi “munkayulu we haana ku Nzambi.” <verse eid="MRK 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 7:12" />Mu bobobo, luheeni luve ku muntu bewowo mu lembolo sadisa tata andi hoti ngudi andi! <verse eid="MRK 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 7:13" />Ni bwabobo lukwe bikilanga Mambu ma Nzambi mu sadila kinkulu kyeno ki lulonga. Mpe lukwe hidikanga misamu mihiika mi bobobo.»<verse eid="MRK 7:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 7:14" />Yesu wutumisa dyaka mpumbu yi bantu na wubateela ti: «Nyuwileeno, yeno bamvimba mpe bakuleeno: <verse eid="MRK 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 7:15" />Kunaani kima ki ku mbazi kikotidi mu nitu yi muntu, kilendi musumuna, kansi ni kikwe duukanga mu muntu, kikwe musumunanga.» <verse eid="MRK 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 7:16" />[Tala ti muntu wuu na makutu mu yuwa, bika kayuwa!] <verse eid="MRK 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 7:17" />Yesu bu kasisa mpumbu yi bantu, wukota mu nzo, na milongoki myandi mimufuula mbangudulu yi kingana bekyokyo. <verse eid="MRK 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 7:18" />Wubateela ti: «Yeno mpe luu na madyela ko e? Luna bakula ko ti kunaani kima ki ku mbazi kikotidi mu nitu yi muntu, kilendi musumuna e? <verse eid="MRK 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 7:19" />Mu dyambu ti, byobyo bikwe kotanga mu mutima andi ko, kansi mu moyo andi, mboki bikwe duukanga ku mbazi.» Yandi wuzonzila bobo mu ta ti bima bimvimba bivedila bidi. <verse eid="MRK 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 7:20" />Wubwesa dyaka ti: «Ni misamu mikwe duukanga mu muntu mikwe mu sumunanga. <verse eid="MRK 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 7:21" />Mu dyambu ti, ni mu kati, ni mu nsye mutima wu muntu, mu kwe fumanga mbanzulu zimbi, kindumba, bwivi na kuhonda, <verse eid="MRK 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 7:22" />kinsuza, mpwila ze baka, mbalu, luvunu, kindumba, nzinunu, bituku, mayama na buhulu. <verse eid="MRK 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 7:23" />Misamu mimvimba mimbi bemyomyo mikwe fumanga ku nsye mutima na mikwe sumunanga muntu.»<verse eid="MRK 7:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu wunyakisa mwana wu mukento wumosi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 15:21-28">Mat 15.21-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 7:24" />Mboki Yesu wukatuka huma behoho na wuyenda ku kizunga ki zimbanza Tile na Sidoni. Wukota mu nzo yimosi, mpe wutya ti nakani muntu kazabandi wo, kansi wulembakana mu ba wuswama. <verse eid="MRK 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 7:25" />Mukento wumosi, wuba na mwana wu mukento wukwamusu ku mpeve yimbi, wuyuwa bu bedi zonzilanga Yesu na wuyiza bwa ha malu mandi. <verse eid="MRK 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 7:26" />Mukento bewowo wuba Mungeleke, wubutuka ku mbanza yi Fenisi mu kizunga ki Siliya. Wulomba Yesu mu kuma mpeve yimbi yitotoka mu mwana andi. <verse eid="MRK 7:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 7:27" />Kansi Yesu wumuteela ti: «Bika ntete baala bateka yukuta, mu dyambu ti budi bumbote ko mu bonga dimpa di baala na mulosa dyo ku mwa baala bambwa.» <verse eid="MRK 7:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 7:28" />Mukento wumuvutudila ti: «Mfumu, mwa baala bambwa ku nsye meza, bakwe dyanga nsyebodi zimampa zikwe sotonanga baala.» <verse eid="MRK 7:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 7:29" />Buna Yesu wumuteela ti: «Mu dyambu di mvutu beyoyo, yenda: mpeve yimbi yiduukidi mu mwana aku wu mukento.» <verse eid="MRK 7:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 7:30" />Bu kavutuka ku nzo andi, wubwana mwana andi wu mukento wuba wulambalala ha mbuka: mpeve yimbi yiduuka mu yandi.<verse eid="MRK 7:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu wunyakisa muntu wufwa makutu na wedi zonzilanga mu mpasi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 7:31" />Yesu wukatuka ku mbanza yi Tile na wuvutuka ku mbanza yi Sidoni ku ntendo mubu wu Ngalili, wuhyokila ku kizunga ki Dekapoli. <verse eid="MRK 7:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 7:32" />Batwala ku Yesu muntu wumosi wufwa makutu wedi zonzilanga mu mpasi. Bamubombidila kamutentika moko. <verse eid="MRK 7:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 7:33" />Yesu wumunata ha nsoso, kitatu na mpumbu yi bantu, wumutuula milembo mu makutu, wulobola mante mu milembo, mpe wusimba ludimi lu muntu bewowo. <verse eid="MRK 7:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 7:34" />Mboki wusendola meso ku yulu, wuhumuna na wumuteela ti: «Efata!» Mpila mosi ti: «Zibuka!» <verse eid="MRK 7:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 7:35" />Makutu mandi matumbu zibuka, ludimi lwandi lulenga na wedi zonza bumbote. <verse eid="MRK 7:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 7:36" />Mboki Yesu wubakanikina mulembolo we ta ku kani muntu, kansi bu kedi vula we bakanikina, yawu bavula we samuna. <verse eid="MRK 7:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 7:37" />Bantu batoma yituku, na bata ti: «Mimvimba mi kana hidika, mimbote midi! Wuna sa ti bantu bana makutu mafwa bayuwa mpe wuna zonzisa mababa!»<verse eid="MRK 7:37" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="MRK 8" />
  <para style="s1">Yesu wudikila mafunda maya ma babakala</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 15:32-39">Mat 15.32-39</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 8:1" />Mu bilumbu bebyobyo kwandi, pumbu yi bantu yiyinene yikutakana dyaka mpe yiba na kima kye dya ko. Yesu wutumisa milongoki myandi na wubateela ti: <verse eid="MRK 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 8:2" />«Kyadi kikingi nina yenina mpumbu yi bantu beyiyi, mu dyambu ti kii ni kilumbu ki bitatu ki baa kintwadi naani, mpe baa na kima kye dya ko. <verse eid="MRK 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 8:3" />Tala ti na bavutudi mu zinzo zawu na nsatu, baba na ngolo ko mu nzila, mu dyambu ti ha kati dyawu, bahiika kukula bafumini.» <verse eid="MRK 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 8:4" />Milongoki mi muvutudila ti: «Kwedi twabakila mampa mu badikila bayukuta haha ha kibuka ki kilembolo kima e?» <verse eid="MRK 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 8:5" />Yesu wubafuula ti: «Mampa makwa maa neeno e?» Bavutula ti: «Nsambwadi.» <verse eid="MRK 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 8:6" />Wulomba ku mpumbu yi bantu bazakala ha nsi. Mboki, wubonga mampa nsambwadi, bu kavutula matondo, wubukuna mo na wuhaana mo ku milongoki myandi mu kabula mo ku bamvimba. <verse eid="MRK 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 8:7" />Yawu baba mpe na mwa ndambu yi zimbizi zifyoti. Yesu wusakumuna zo, mpe wulomba ku milongoki myandi bakabula zo mpe. <verse eid="MRK 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 8:8" />Bamvimba badya, bayukuta. Mboki batota mikuta nsambwadi mifuluka mu bibuku bisadila. <verse eid="MRK 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 8:9" />Bantu badya baba kampe mafunda maya (4000). Mboki Yesu wubavutula, <verse eid="MRK 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 8:10" />yandi wutumbu kota mu mulungu na milongoki myandi mpe wuyenda ku kizunga ki Dalamanuta.<verse eid="MRK 8:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bafalisi na basaduki bana lomba kidimbu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 16:1-4">Mat 16.1-4</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 8:11" />Bafalisi bayiza na batona mu sa mpaka na Yesu. Mu mutonta bamulomba kidimbu kyaafuma ku yulu. <verse eid="MRK 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 8:12" />Yesu wuhumuna mu kitezo kingolo na wuta ti: «Bila nki mbandu beyiyi yina lombila kidimbu e? Kedika nina luteela, nakani kidimbu kimosi bahaana kyo ku mbandu beyiyi ko.» <verse eid="MRK 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 8:13" />Mboki wusala basisa, wukota dyaka mu mulungu na wuyenda ku simu dihiika.<verse eid="MRK 8:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ndongosolo yi Bafalisi na yi ba-Elode</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 16:5-12">Mat 16.5-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 8:14" />Milongoki bazimbakana mu nata mampa. Dimpa dimosi kwandi diba nawu mu kati di mulungu. <verse eid="MRK 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 8:15" />Yesu wubahaana ntumunu eyi: «Kebeeno kweno! Mu kima kikwe vimbisanga kiputi ki Bafalisi na ki Elode.» <verse eid="MRK 8:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 8:16" />Milongoki mita yawu na yawu ti: «Mu dyambu ti tuu na mampa ko.» <verse eid="MRK 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 8:17" />Yesu wubakula mayindu mawu na wubateela ti: «Bila nki luna telasana ti luu na mampa ko e? Luna bakula ko e? Mpe luna zaba ko e? Mitima myeno mikangama midi e? <verse eid="MRK 8:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 8:18" />Luu na meso, kansi luna yena ko e? Luu na makutu, kansi luna yuwa ko e? Luna bambuka ko <verse eid="MRK 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 8:19" />bu nakabula mampa matanu ku mafunda matanu (5000) ma babakala, mikuta mifuluka mu bibuku, mikwa luyonzika e?» Yawu bamuvutudila ti: «kumi na myole (12).» <verse eid="MRK 8:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 8:20" />«Mpe bu nakabula mampa nsambwadi ku mafunda maya (4000) ma babakala, mikuta mikwa mifuluka mu bibuku lunata e?» Yawu bavutula ti, «Nsambwadi.» <verse eid="MRK 8:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 8:21" />Mpe wubateela ti: «Bwedi luna lembolo bakudila e?»<verse eid="MRK 8:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu wunyakisa mpofo ku Betesayida</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 8:22" />Bayenda ku mbanza Betesayida. Banata mpofo yimosi ku Yesu na bamubombidila kamusimba. <verse eid="MRK 8:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 8:23" />Wusimba mpofo mu kooko na wumunata ku mbazi yi bwala, mboki wumutuula mante mu meso, wumutentika moko na wumufuula ti: «Nganunu wuna yena kima e?» <verse eid="MRK 8:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 8:24" />Mpofo wuzibula meso na wuta ti: «Nina yena bantu, baa bonso miti mi nakwe yendi.» <verse eid="MRK 8:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 8:25" />Yesu wusimba dyaka meso mandi. Mpofo bu ka zibula meso wutoma yena bumbote, wunyaka mpe wuswasisa bimvimba bi kayena. <verse eid="MRK 8:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 8:26" />Buna Yesu wumuvutula ku nzo andi na wumuteela ti: «Kukotandi ku bwala ko.»<verse eid="MRK 8:26" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Petelo wubakula ti Yesu ni Klisto</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 16:13-20">Mat 16.13-20</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:18-21">Luk 9.18-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 8:27" />Yesu na milongoki myandi bayenda ku mabwala maba lukufi na bwala bu Kayisali yi Filipi. Mu nzila, wubafuula ti: «Mu nzonzolo zi bantu, meno nani nidi e?» <verse eid="MRK 8:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 8:28" />Bamuvutudila ti: «Yawu bana ta ti Yoane Mumbotiki wudi, bahiika ti Eliya, bahiika dyaka ti wumosi mu mimbikudi.» <verse eid="MRK 8:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 8:29" />Na wubafuula ti: «Mbo mu yeno, meno nani nidi e?» Petelo wumuvutudila ti: «Ngeye ni Klisto!» <verse eid="MRK 8:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 8:30" />Ku manina, Yesu wubakanikina mu nkasu mulembolo we ta ku kani muntu.<verse eid="MRK 8:30" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu wuzabikisa lufwa na mfulukulu andi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 16:21-23">Mat 16.21-23</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:22">Luk 9.22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 8:31" />Yesu wutona mu longa milongoki myandi ti: «Mwana Muntu fweti yena mpasi zizingi, baamunyafuna ku bakuluntu, ku zimfumu zinganga-Nzambi na milongisi mi Misiku. Baamuhonda na mu kilumbu kibitatu, waafuluka mu bafwa.» <verse eid="MRK 8:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 8:32" />Wubateela myo na kabasweka kani musamu ko. Buna Petelo wumunata ha luhengo na wutona mu musemba. <verse eid="MRK 8:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 8:33" />Kansi Yesu wubaluka, wutala milongoki myandi na wusemba Petelo mu muteela ti: «Satana, nkatukila! Mu dyambu ti mabanza maku ka mabanza ma Nzambi ko, kansi ma bantu.»<verse eid="MRK 8:33" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bwedi tulendi landila Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 16:24-28">Mat 16.24-28</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:23-27">Luk 9.23-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 8:34" />Mboki, Yesu wutumisa mpumbu yi bantu na milongoki myandi, mpe wubateela ti: «Tala ti muntu tiidi mu ba mulongoki ani, kakizimbakana yandi bende, kananguna kulunsi dyandi na kandanda. <verse eid="MRK 8:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 8:35" />Mu dyambu ti wonso muntu waasosa mu vuukisa luzingu lwandi, lwaakahombisa. Kansi wonso muntu waahombisa luzingu lwandi mu dyambu dyani na mu Musamu Wumbote, lwaakavuukisa. <verse eid="MRK 8:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 8:36" />Nkye ndandu kwandi ku muntu waabaka bimvwama bi nza yimvimba, tala ti hombisi luzingu lwandi e? <verse eid="MRK 8:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 8:37" />Nki muntu kalendi haana mu hingisa luzingu lwandi e? <verse eid="MRK 8:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 8:38" />Mu dyambu ti, wonso muntu waayena nsoni mu meno na mu Mambu mani ha kati di mbandu beyiyi yi kinsuza na yisumuka, buna Mwana Muntu mpe mbo kamuyenina nsoni mu ntangu yi kaavutuka mu mukembo wu Tata andi na zimbazi zilongo.»<verse eid="MRK 8:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="MRK 9" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 9:1" />Yesu wubateela ti: «Kedika nina luteela, mwa ndambu bantu mu yobobo ba haha, baakifwila ko tekila bayena kimfumu ki Nzambi kyaakwiza mu lulendo.»<verse eid="MRK 9:1" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu wukituka</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 17:1-8">Mat 17.1-8</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:28-36">Luk 9.28-36</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 9:2" />Bilumbu bisambanu bihyoka, Yesu wubonga Petelo, Zaki na Yoane na wubanata ha yawu hiika, ha lweka ha yulu mulandu wuwula. Yesu wukituka ha ntadisi awu <verse eid="MRK 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 9:3" />binkutu byandi bikituka na vekoveko, bitoma ba bimpembe, mpe nakani muntu ha butoto kalendi duukisa mpembe yibobo ko. <verse eid="MRK 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 9:4" />Mpe Eliya na Mose bayenika ku yawu na ya babole bedi mokana na Yesu. <verse eid="MRK 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 9:5" />Petelo wuteela Yesu ti: «Mulongisi, bumbote ti tuzakala ha. Tutungeeno zinzo zitatu zi bikapu, yimosi yi yaku, yimosi yi Mose na yimosi yi Eliya.» <verse eid="MRK 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 9:6" />Kedi zaba ko nki ka ta, mu dyambu ti bayena bunkuta bubwingi. <verse eid="MRK 9:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 9:7" />Buna tuti diyiza bafuka ku nsye mposi andi. Mpe ndinga yimosi yiyuwakana ku nsye tuti: «Yandi ewu ni mwana ani wu ntomini tya. Muyuwileeno!» <verse eid="MRK 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 9:8" />Hansi na nsi, bazungisa meso ha babela, kansi bayena muntu wuhiika ko, Yesu yandi hiika kwandi wuba nawu. <verse eid="MRK 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 9:9" />Mu ntangu yi bedi kulumuka mulandu, Yesu wubahaana ntumunu eyi: «Lutandi misamu mi luyeni ku muntu ko, natee Mwana Muntu bu kaafuluka mu bafwa.» <verse eid="MRK 9:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 9:10" />Bavumina ntumunu beyoyo, mpe yawu na yawu bakifula ti: «Mfulukulu mu bafwa, bangudulu nki e?»<verse eid="MRK 9:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kyuhu mu dyambu di Eliya</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 17:10-13">Mat 17.10-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 9:11" />Mboki, milongoki mifuula Yesu ti: «Bila nki milongisi mi Misiku mikwe teelanga ti Eliya fweti kwiza ntete e?» <verse eid="MRK 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 9:12" />Wubavutudila ti: «Eliya fweti kwiza ntete mu sungika misamu mimvimba. Bila nki Masonama mana teela dyaka ti Mwana Muntu, fweti yena mpasi zizingi, mpe bafweti mu bisa e? <verse eid="MRK 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 9:13" />Kansi meno nina luteela ti: Eliya wuyiza na bamuhidika mi batya mu muhidika. Bonso bu midi misonama mu yandi.»<verse eid="MRK 9:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu wunyakisa mwana wuba na mpeve yimbi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 17:14-21">Mat 17.14-21</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:37-43">Luk 9.37-43</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 9:14" />Bu bavutuka ku bela milongoki mihiika, bayena mpumbu yi bantu yi bazungidila na milongisi mi Misiku myedi bindana nawu mpaka. <verse eid="MRK 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 9:15" />Mpumbu yi bantu bu yitumbu yena Yesu, bapamuka na bayenda mu ntiinu mu kwe muhaana mbote. <verse eid="MRK 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 9:16" />Yesu wubafuula ti: «Nkye musamu luna bindasana mpaka nawu e?» <verse eid="MRK 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 9:17" />Muntu wumosi ha kati di mpumbu yi bantu wuvutula ti: «Mulongisi, nikutwadidi mwana ani wu bakala, mu dyambu wuu na mpeve yimbi yikwe mu kitulanga baba. <verse eid="MRK 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 9:18" />Konso-konso kuma ku yikwe mulwatanga, yikwe mubwisanga ha nsi, mwana wukwe duukisanga mafulu mu munwa, wukwe kwetisanga meno, mpe nitu andi yikwe kangamanga. Ndombidi ku milongoki myaku bakuma yo, kansi balembani kwawu.» <verse eid="MRK 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 9:19" />Yesu wubateela ti: «Ha! Yi mbandu yilembolo ba na lukwikulu! Ntangu zikwa naaba neeno e? Mpe ntangu zikwa naaluvibidila e? Mutwaleeno ehaha.» <verse eid="MRK 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 9:20" />Bamutwadila wo. Mwana bu wutumbu yena Yesu, mpeve yimbi yi muningisa mu ngolo, wubwa ha nsi, wuvindumuka na mafulu ma muduuka mu munwa. <verse eid="MRK 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 9:21" />Yesu wufuula ku tata ti: «Yeka ntangu zikwa misamu bemimi mikwe mutudilanga e?» Tata wuvutula ti: «Tuka bumwana bwandi. <verse eid="MRK 9:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 9:22" />Mpeve yimbi yikwe vula mubwisanga ku tiya na mu mamba mu muhonda. Tala ti lendi sa dyambu, tufwila nkenda na tusadisa.» <verse eid="MRK 9:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 9:23" />Yesu wumuvutudila ti: «Ebu teedi ti tala ti lendi sa dyambu! Misamu mimvimba mikwe hilamanga ku wonso muntu kwe sanga kiminu.» <verse eid="MRK 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 9:24" />Hansi na nsi tata di mwana wubulana ti: «Nkwikidi, nsadisa mu dyambu ti nii na kiminu ko!» <verse eid="MRK 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 9:25" />Yesu wuyena ti mpumbu yi bantu bayiza mu muswalu, buna wubamina mpeve yimbi ti: «Mpeve yimbi yifwa makutu, mpe yi bubaba, nina kutuma duuka mu mwana bewuwu, mpe kubwesandi vutuka mu yandi!» <verse eid="MRK 9:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 9:26" />Mpeve yimbi yi bulana, yi ningisa mwana mu ngolo mpe yiduuka. Mwana wukituka bonso muntu wufwa, bantu babingi bata ti: «Fwidi.» <verse eid="MRK 9:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 9:27" />Kansi Yesu wumusimba mu kooko, wumutedimisa, mpe mwana wutelama.<verse eid="MRK 9:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 9:28" />Yesu bu kavutuka ku nzo, milongoki myandi mimufuula bu baba yawu hiika ti: «Bila nki yeto tulembinini mu kuma mpeve yimbi beyoyo e?» <verse eid="MRK 9:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 9:29" />Yesu wubateela ti: «Mpeve yibobo, mu lusambulu kaka yilendi duukila.»<verse eid="MRK 9:29" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu wuzabikisa dyaka lufwa na mfulukulu andi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 17:22-23">Mat 17.22-23</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:43-45">Luk 9.43-45</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 9:30" />Bu bakatuka ha kibuka bekyokyo, bahyokila mu kizunga ki Ngalili, mpe Yesu katya ko ti bantu bazaba. <verse eid="MRK 9:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 9:31" />Mu dyambu ti wedi longanga milongoki myandi na wedi bateela ti: «Baayekola Mwana Muntu mu moko ma bantu, baamuhonda, mpe kilumbu kitatu waafuluka mu bafwa.» <verse eid="MRK 9:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 9:32" />Kansi milongoki mibakula misamu bemyomyo ko, mpe myedi yena bunkuta mu mufuula.<verse eid="MRK 9:32" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nani hyokidi bunene ha kati dyeno</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 18:1-5">Mat 18.1-5</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:46-48">Luk 9.46-48</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 9:33" />Batula ha mbanza yi Kapenawumi. Bu kaba mu nzo, Yesu wufuula milongoki myandi ti: «Nkye musamu lukwe kwe bindisinini mpaka mu nzila e? <verse eid="MRK 9:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 9:34" />Kansi yawu bavutula kani mvutu ko, mu dyambu ti mu nzila babindasana mpaka mu zaba nani ha kati dyawu hyokidi bunene.» <verse eid="MRK 9:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 9:35" />Buna Yesu wuzakala, wutumisa milongoki kumi na myole (12) na wubateela ti: «Tala ti muntu tiidi mu ba wuntete, fweti ba wumansukina mu bamvimba, mpe kisadi ki bamvimba.» <verse eid="MRK 9:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 9:36" />Buna wubonga mwa mwana wufyoti na wumutuula ha kati dyawu, wumubumba, mpe wubateela ti: <verse eid="MRK 9:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 9:37" />«Wonso waatambula mu nkumbu ani wumosi mu baala bafyoti bebaba, meno bende katambudi, mpe yondowo ntambudi, ka meno ko katambudi, kansi tambudi yondowo wumfidisi.»<verse eid="MRK 9:37" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wonso lembolo ba mutantu eno ni mukundi eno</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 9:49-50">Luk 9.49-50</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 9:38" />Yoane wuta ti: «Mulongisi, tuyeni muntu wumosi wuna kuma mpeve zimbi mu nkumbu aku, ni tusosidi mu mukanikina mu dyambu ti kana kwe tulandi ko.» <verse eid="MRK 9:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 9:39" />Yesu wumuvutudila ti: «Lumukanikinandi ko, mu dyambu ti ka kuu muntu wulendi hidika kimangu mu nkumbu ani, mpe ha manima katumbu zonzila bumbi mu meno. <verse eid="MRK 9:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 9:40" />Yondowo wulembolo ba mutantu eto, mukundi eto wudi . <verse eid="MRK 9:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 9:41" />Wonso muntu waaluhaana mbungu yi mamba mu nwa mu nkumbu ani, mu dyambu ti luvwihulu ku Klisto, kedika nina luteela, yandi kaahombisa musendo andi ko.»<verse eid="MRK 9:41" /></para>
  <para style="s">Malongi mu kebisa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 18:6-9">Mat 18.6-9</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 17:1-2">Luk 17.1-2</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 9:42" />Kansi wonso muntu waabwisa mu masumu wumosi mu baala bebaba bafyoti bakwe kwikilanga mu meno, bumbote ku yandi bamukanga tadi didinene mu nsingu na bamulosa mu mubu. <verse eid="MRK 9:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 9:43" />Tala ti kooko kwaku kukwe kubwisanga mu masumu, tabula ko, bumbote ku ngeye mu kota mu luzingu lukedika na kooko kumosi na mu tubu na moko maku ma mamole ku tiya tu mbungulu tukwe lembolo zimanga. [ <verse eid="MRK 9:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 9:44" />Kokoko kukwe lembolo fwanga bitatika, mpe tiya tukwe lembolo zimanga.] <verse eid="MRK 9:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 9:45" />Tala ti kuulu kwaku kukwe kubwisanga mu masumu, tabula ko, bumbote ku ngeye mu kota mu luzingu lukedika na kuulu kumosi na mu tubu na malu maku ma mamole ku tiya tu mbungulu tukwe lembolo zimanga. [ <verse eid="MRK 9:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 9:46" />Kokoko kukwe lembolo fwanga bitatika, mpe tiya tukwe lembolo zimanga.] <verse eid="MRK 9:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 9:47" />Tala ti diisu dyaku dikwe kubwisanga mu masumu, katula dyo, bumbote mu kota mu Kimfumu ki mazulu na diisu dimosi na mu tubu na meso ma mamole ku tiya tu mbungulu. <verse eid="MRK 9:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MRK 9:48" />Kokoko kukwe lembolo fwanga bitatika, mpe tiya tukwe lembolo zimanga. <verse eid="MRK 9:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MRK 9:49" />Mu dyambu ti, kadi muntu waahyokila ku tiya tu mpasi, mpe waayobila mungwa mu ba wuvedila. <verse eid="MRK 9:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MRK 9:50" />Mungwa wumbote, kansi tala ti weka na zubulu, bwedi lulendi we vutudila nzenzo e? Beeno na nzenzo yi mungwa mu kati dyeno, mpe beeno mu kiyenge yeno na yeno.<verse eid="MRK 9:50" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="MRK 10" />
  <para style="s">Ndongosolo mu dyambu di mpondolo yi makwela</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 19:1-12">Mat 19.1-12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 16:18">Luk 16.18</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 10:1" />Yesu wukatuka huma behoho, mpe wuyenda ku kizunga ki Yuda, kusimu dihiika di nzadi yi Yolodani. Mpumbu yi bantu yikutakana dyaka ha kaba, mpe bonso buba kifu kyandi, wubalonga dyaka. <verse eid="MRK 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 10:2" />Bafalisi bafinama ha kabela mu mutonta. Bamufuula ti: «Nganunu, bakala wuu na luve mu kuma mukento andi e?» <verse eid="MRK 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 10:3" />Wubavutudila ti: «Nkye ntumunu Mose kaluhaana e?» <verse eid="MRK 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 10:4" />Bamuteela ti: «Mose wuhaana luve ku bakala mu sonika mukanda we hondila makwela mpe kakuma mukento.» <verse eid="MRK 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 10:5" />Buna Yesu wubateela ti: «Mu dyambu di mutima ngolo eno, Mose ka lusonikina ntumunu beyoyo. <verse eid="MRK 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 10:6" />Kansi ku mbadukulu yi nza, Nzambi “wuhidika mukento na bakala,” <verse eid="MRK 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 10:7" />“ni hahoho, bakala kaafweti sisa nzo yi ngudi andi na tata andi mu kwenda ba na mukento andi <verse eid="MRK 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 10:8" />mpe ya babole baaba muntu wumosi.” Buna basidi dyaka bantu bole ko, kansi muntu wumosi. <verse eid="MRK 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 10:9" />Ni hahoho, muntu kalendi hambisa yobobo babundidi Nzambi ko.» <verse eid="MRK 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 10:10" />Bu bavutuka ku nzo, milongoki mifuula dyaka Yesu mu musamu bewowo. <verse eid="MRK 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 10:11" />Wubavutudila ti: «Tala ti bakala dikumini mukento andi na kwedidi wuhiika, sadidi kinsuza ku mukento andi wuntete, <verse eid="MRK 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 10:12" />mpe tala ti mukento bisidi mulumi andi na kwedidi bakala dihiika, sadidi kinsuza.»<verse eid="MRK 10:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu wusakumuna baala bafyoti</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 19:13-15">Mat 19.13-15</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:15-17">Luk 18.15-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 10:13" />Bantu banata baala bafyoti ku Yesu mwanki kabatentika moko. Kansi milongoki mi basemba. <verse eid="MRK 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 10:14" />Yesu bu kayena bobo, wufwema na wubateela ti: «Bikeeno baala bafyoti biza kuu meno, lubakakidilandi ko mu dyambu ti kimfumu ki Nzambi kifwanakani ku yobobo ba bonso yawu. <verse eid="MRK 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 10:15" />Kedika nina luteela, yondowo walembolo tambula kimfumu ki Nzambi bonso mwana wufyoti, kalendi mwe kota ko.» <verse eid="MRK 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 10:16" />Mboki, Yesu wubabonga mu moko mandi, wubatentika moko mu basakumuna.<verse eid="MRK 10:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Muntu wumvwama na Kimfumu ki Nzambi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 19:16-30">Mat 19.16-30</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:18-30">Luk 18.18-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 10:17" />Yesu bu katamana nzila andi, muntu wumosi wunooka mpe wufukama ha ntadisi andi mpe wumufuula ti: «Mulongisi wumbote, nki nafweti sa mu tambula luzingu lu mimvu ka mimvu e?» <verse eid="MRK 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 10:18" />Yesu wumuvutudila ti: «Bila nki wuna ntumisina muntu wumbote e? Ka kuu muntu wudi wumbote, tala ti ka Nzambi kaka ko. <verse eid="MRK 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 10:19" />Misiku myazebi: “Kuhondandi ko, kusadilandi kinsuza ko, kuyibandi ko, kutandi kimbangi ki luvunu ko, kusandi bumbi ku muntu ko, zitisa tata aku na ngudi aku”» <verse eid="MRK 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 10:20" />Wumuvutudila ti: «Mulongisi, tuuka kintwenya kyani, nakwe toma vuminanga misiku mimvimba bemyomyo.» <verse eid="MRK 10:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 10:21" />Bu kamutala, Yesu wumutya na wumuteela ti: «Musamu wumosi kaka wulembolo ba naku: yadika bima byaku bimvimba, haana byo ku bamiwelo, mbo wubaka kimvwama ku mazulu. Mboki, yiza mpe ndanda.» <verse eid="MRK 10:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 10:22" />Kansi bu kayuwa bobo, bito bimunooka mpe wuyenda ku nsye kyadi, mu dyambu ti wuba na bimvwama bibingi.<verse eid="MRK 10:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 10:23" />Yesu wusungimina milongoki myandi mi muzungudila na wubateela ti: «Mpasi zizingi ku yobobo baa na bimvwama mu kota mu kimfumu ki Nzambi!»<verse eid="MRK 10:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 10:24" />Milongoki miyena bunkuta bu bayuwa bobo. Yesu ni kabateela dyaka ti: «Baala bani mpasi zizingi zidi mu kota mu kimfumu ki Nzambi! <verse eid="MRK 10:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 10:25" />Bulutidi nayaki-yaki ku kibulu ki nkumbu yi samo mu lutila ha mwa bulu di ntumbu, kansi ka mvwama ko mu kota mu kimfumu ki Nzambi.» <verse eid="MRK 10:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 10:26" />Milongoki mivula yituku na bakifulasana yawu na yawu ti: «Buna nani kwandi waavuuka e?» <verse eid="MRK 10:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 10:27" />Yesu wubasungimina na wubateela ti: «Misamu mii mpasi ku bantu mu hidika, mii mpasi ku Nzambi ko, mu dyambu ti Nzambi kalembananga dyambu ko.»<verse eid="MRK 10:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 10:28" />Buna Petelo wumuteela ti: «Bwabu yeto tumeni sisa bimvimba mu kulanda.» <verse eid="MRK 10:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 10:29" />Yesu wumuteela ti: «Kedika nina luteela, kunaani muntu waasisa mu dyambu dyani na di Musamu Wumbote, nzo andi hoti mpangi zandi zi babakala, bibusi byandi, tata andi, ngudi andi na baala bandi, hoti mfuba zandi, <verse eid="MRK 10:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 10:30" />waalembolo baka mu ntangu beyiyi nkumbu nkama (100): zinzo, mpangi zi babakala, bibusi, matata, zingudi, baala, na zimfuba na mfyetokoso mpe, na mu ntangu yina kwiza, luzingu lu mimvu ka mimvu. <verse eid="MRK 10:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 10:31" />Kansi babingi batekila baazimunina, mboki babingi bazimunina baatekila.»<verse eid="MRK 10:31" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mu nkumbu yi tatu, Yesu wuzabikisa lufwa na mfulukulu andi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 20:17-19">Mat 20.17-19</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:31-34">Luk 18.31-34</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 10:32" />Bu baba mu nzila mu tomboka ku mbanza Yelusalemi, Yesu wedi kwe yendi ku mutu wu milongoki myandi, miba ku nsye mayindu na yobobo bedi kwe mulandi baba na bunkuta. Yesu wubonga dyaka ha kimosi nandi milongoki kumi na myole (12), mpe wutona mu bateela misamu mya mutudidila. <verse eid="MRK 10:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 10:33" />«Tuna tomboka ku Yelusalemi mpe Mwana Muntu baamuyekola mu moko ma zimfumu zinganga-Nzambi na milongisi mi Misiku. Baamuzengila lufwa na baamuyekola ku bantu balembolo ba Bayudayo. <verse eid="MRK 10:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 10:34" />Baamuvweza, baamulobodila mante, baamuzuba bikoti na baamuhonda. Kansi mu kilumbu kibitatu waafuluka mu bafwa.»<verse eid="MRK 10:34" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ndombolo yi Yoane na yi Zaki</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 20:20-28">Mat 20.20-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 10:35" />Buna Yoane na Zaki, baala ba Zebedayi bayenda ha ba Yesu. Bamuteela ti: «Mulongisi, tutidi wutuhidikila misamu mi twaakulomba.» <verse eid="MRK 10:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 10:36" />Wubateela ti: «Nki lutidi naaluhidikila e?» <verse eid="MRK 10:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 10:37" />Bamuteela ti: «Sa ti tuzakala ha ndambu aku, wumosi ku kooko kwaku kulumoso na wuhiika ku kooko kwaku ku lubakala bu waaba mu nkembo aku.» <verse eid="MRK 10:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 10:38" />Kansi Yesu wubateela ti: «Luzebi mi luna ndomba ko. Lulendi nwa mbungu yi naanwa meno e? Hoti lulendi tambula mbotokolo yi naatambula e?» <verse eid="MRK 10:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 10:39" />Bamuvutudila ti: «Ninga, tulendi lenda.» Yesu wubateela ti: «Wu makedika, lwaanwa mbungu yi naanwa mpe lwaatambula mbotokolo yi naatambula. <verse eid="MRK 10:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 10:40" />Kansi ka meno ko nii na luve mu zenga nani lendi zakala ku kooko kwani ku lumoso mpe ku kooko kwani ku lubakala. Bibuka bebyobyo bidi bi yobobo ba kakubikila byo.» <verse eid="MRK 10:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 10:41" />Bu bayuwa bobo, milongoki kumi mihiika mitona mu fwemina Zaki na Yoane. <verse eid="MRK 10:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 10:42" />Yesu wubatumisa na wubateela ti: «Luzebi ti yobobo ba bakwe bongilanga bonso zimfumu, bonso zimfumu bakwe tumanga bantu. Mpe yobobo baa na lulendo bakwe yenisa bantu mpasi. <verse eid="MRK 10:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 10:43" />Kansi kaabubelandi bobo mu yeno. Yondowo tiidi muba muntu wumfunu ha kati dyeno kaba kisadi kyeno, <verse eid="MRK 10:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 10:44" />na yondowo tiidi muba wuntete ha kati dyeno kaba mundongo wu bamvimba. <verse eid="MRK 10:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 10:45" />Mu dyambu ti Mwana Muntu kayizidi ko ku bantu mwanki bamusadila, kansi mu sadila na mu haana luzingu lwandi bonso mufutu mu kuula bantu babingi.»<verse eid="MRK 10:45" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu wunyakisa mpofo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 20:29-34">Mat 20.29-34</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:35-43">Luk 18.35-43</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 10:46" />Batula ku mbanza Yeliko. Yesu bu kedi duuka mu mbanza na milongoki myandi na mpumbu yi bantu babingi, mpofo yimosi nkumbu andi Batimayi, mwana wu Time wuba wuzakala ha ntendo nzila na wedi sanga mundombila. <verse eid="MRK 10:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 10:47" />Bu kayuwa ti ni Yesu mwisi-Nazaleti, wutona mu bulana ti: «Yesu, Mwana Davidi, wumfwila nkenda!» <verse eid="MRK 10:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MRK 10:48" />Bantu babingi ba mu bamina mwanki kakanga munwa andi, kansi wubulana dyaka mu ngolo ti: «Mwana Davidi, wumfwila nkenda!» <verse eid="MRK 10:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MRK 10:49" />Yesu wutelama na wuta ti: «Mutumiseeno.» Batumisa mpofo na bamuteela ti: «Lwata kibakala, telama, wuna kutumisa.» <verse eid="MRK 10:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MRK 10:50" />Mpofo wulosa kiyunga kyandi, wutelama mu manzangu, mpe wuyenda kubeela Yesu. <verse eid="MRK 10:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="MRK 10:51" />Yesu ti: «Nki tiidi na kusila e?» Mpofo wumuvutudila ti: «Labuni», mbangudulu ti: «Mulongisi, sa ti nabwesa yena dyaka!» <verse eid="MRK 10:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="MRK 10:52" />Yesu wumuteela ti: «Yenda, kiminu kyaku ki kuvuukisi.» Ni katumbu yena, na wulanda Yesu mu nzila.<verse eid="MRK 10:52" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="MRK 11" />
  <para style="s">Nkotolo yi Yesu ku Yelusalemi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:1-11">Mat 21.1-11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 19:28-40">Luk 19.28-40</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 12:12-19">Yoa 12.12-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 11:1" />Bu baba bela-bela na mbanza Yelusalemi ku ntendo yi mabwala ma Betefange na Betani, bela-bela na mulandu wu Olive, Yesu wutambika myole mu milongoki myandi. <verse eid="MRK 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 11:2" />Mpe wubateela ti: «Yendeeno ha bwala buu ku mutwala eno. Bu lwaatumbu kota ha bwala, lwaayena mwana mbuluku wuu wukangama, waka wameki muntu. Nyanguneeno wo, mpe twaleeno wo. <verse eid="MRK 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 11:3" />Tala ti muntu wulufuudidi: “Bila nki luna nyangunina wo e?” Muteeleeno ti: “Mfumu nsatu kaa na wo, mpe mbo kabwesa vutula wo kwandi mu muswalu ehaha.”»<verse eid="MRK 11:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 11:4" />Milongoki miyenda na mibwana mwana mbuluku wuba wukangama ha mbazi ha ntendo mwelo, mu nzila. Ni banyanguna wo. <verse eid="MRK 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 11:5" />Mwa ndambu yi yobobo baba hoho babafuula ti: «Nki luna sa e? Bila nki luna nyangunina mwana mbuluku bewuwu e?» <verse eid="MRK 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 11:6" />Babavutudila bonso Yesu bu kabateela mu ta, mpe bababika benda.<verse eid="MRK 11:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 11:7" />Milongoki minata mwana mbuluku ku Yesu. Batentika binkutu ha yulu mwana mbuluku, mboki Yesu wuzakala ha yulu andi. <verse eid="MRK 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 11:8" />Bantu babingi bedi kwe yadi binkutu byawu mu nzila mpe bahiika mwa bintala bi miti bi bazenga mu zimfuba. <verse eid="MRK 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 11:9" />Yobobo bedi kwe tekidi ku mutwala na bedi kwe landi Yesu ku manima, bedi kwe tengi mu ngolo ti:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 11:9">«Ozana!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 11:9">Bika Nzambi kasakumuna muntu wuna kwiza mu nkumbu yi Mfumu!<verse eid="MRK 11:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 11:10" />Bika Nzambi kasakumuna kimfumu kina kwiza, kimfumu ki Davidi, tata eto! Ozana! Nkembo ku Nzambi mu mazulu mahyokidi kuzangama!» <verse eid="MRK 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 11:11" />Yesu wukota mu mbanza yi Yelusalemi na wuyenda ku nzo-Nzambi. Bu kamanisa mu tala ndambu ka ndambu, wuyenda ku bwala bu Betani na milongoki kumi na myole, buna ntangu yeka kukula.<verse eid="MRK 11:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu wusinga muti wu fike</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:18-22">Mat 21.18-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 11:12" />Mu kilumbu kilanda, bu bedi duuka ku bwala bu Betani, Yesu wubaka nsatu. <verse eid="MRK 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 11:13" />Wuyena kukula muti wumosi wu fike wuba na makaya na wuyenda tala, tala ti lenda baka mbutu, kansi makaya na makaya kwandi kayena. Mu dyambu ti yiba ntangu yi mbutu yi zifike ko. <verse eid="MRK 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 11:14" />Buna Yesu wuteela ku muti wu fike ti: «Nakani muntu kalendi bwesa dya mbutu zaku ko!» Mpe milongoki myandi mimuyuwa.<verse eid="MRK 11:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu wukuma mintekisi mu nzo-Nzambi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:12-17">Mat 21.12-17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 19:45-48">Luk 19.45-48</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 2:13-22">Yoa 2.13-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 11:15" />Batula ku mbanza yi Yelusalemi. Yesu wukota mu nzo-Nzambi na wutona mu kuma yobobo bedi tekanga na bedi sumbanga mu kati di nzo-Nzambi. Wumwangisa meza ma bantu bedi hyakisanga mbongo na byandu bi minteki mi mabembe. <verse eid="MRK 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 11:16" />Kabiika nakani muntu katotoka na kima mu kati di nzo-Nzambi ko. <verse eid="MRK 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 11:17" />Wulonga na wubateela ti: «Wudi wusonama ko ti: “Nzo ani, nzo yi lusambulu baatumisina yo ku bantu ba zinsi zimvimba e?” Kansi, yeno lukitudi yo kiswamunu ki bimpumbulu.» <verse eid="MRK 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 11:18" />Mfumu zinganga-Nzambi na milongisi mi Misiku bu bayuwa wo, ni basosa bwedi bamuhondisila. Kansi bamuyena bunkuta, mu dyambu ti mukangu wumvimba wedi tyanga ndongosolo andi. <verse eid="MRK 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 11:19" />Mpimpa bu yitula, Yesu na milongoki myandi batotoka mu mbanza.<verse eid="MRK 11:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ndongolo yi muti wu fike wu yuma</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:18-22">Mat 21.18-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 11:20" />Kilumbu kilanda na mene, bu bedi hyoka, milongoki miyena muti wu fike wuba wuyuma natee mu myanzi. <verse eid="MRK 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 11:21" />Petelo, wubambuka moyo mu misamu mihyoka, ni kateela Yesu ti: «Mulongisi, tala, muti wu fike wu wusingidi wuyumini.» <verse eid="MRK 11:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 11:22" />Buna Yesu wubavutudila ti: «Beeno na kiminu mu Nzambi.» <verse eid="MRK 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 11:23" />«Kedika nina luteela, tala ti muntu teedi ku mulandu bewuwu: “Katuka hoho na yenda wukituba mu mubu”, mpe tala ti kasiidi maketiketi mu mutima andi ko, kansi kwikidi ti myo mi kateedi myaahilama, myawu myaahilama.» <verse eid="MRK 11:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 11:24" />Ni hahoho nina luteela ti: «Mimvimba mi lwaalomba mu lusambulu, kwikileeno ti mya lutambudi, mpe mya lwaatambula.» <verse eid="MRK 11:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 11:25" />Bu lukwe telamanga mu sambila, tala ti musamu wuu naaku na munaku, mulemvokila, mwanki Tata eno wuu ku mazulu kalulemvokila mpe misamu myeno mimbi. [<verse eid="MRK 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 11:26" />Kansi tala ti lulemvokidi ko, Tata eno wuu ku mazulu, kaalulemvokila mpe misamu myeno mimbi ko.]<verse eid="MRK 11:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kwedi kufuma lutumu lu Yesu?</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:23-27">Mat 21.23-27</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:1-8">Luk 20.1-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 11:27" />Bavutuka dyaka ku mbanza yi Yelusalemi. Yesu bu kedi kwe yungi mu kati di nzo-Nzambi, zimfumu zinganga-Nzambi, milongisi mi misiku na bakuluntu bamukangu bayenda mu yenikina, <verse eid="MRK 11:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 11:28" />na bamufuula ti: «Tuteela, mu lutumu lu nani wuna hidikila misamu bemimi e? Mpe nani wukuheeni lutumu mu hidika myo e?» <verse eid="MRK 11:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 11:29" />Yesu wubavutudila ti: «[Meno mpe] kyuhu kimosi nina luziika, tala ti lumvutudidi mvutu, mbo naluteela mu lutumu lu nani, nina hidikila misamu bemyomyo. <verse eid="MRK 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 11:30" />Mbotokolo yi Yoane, ku Yulu yifuma hoti ku bantu e? Mvutudileeno mvutu.» <verse eid="MRK 11:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 11:31" />Banyunguta yawu na yawu na bata ti: «Ni twaavutula ti “ku Yulu”, mbo katufuula ti: “Mu dyambu di nki lulembolo mukwikila e?” <verse eid="MRK 11:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 11:32" />Tumana vutula ti: “ku bantu”, tufweti tiina mukangu, mu dyambu ti mu mabanza mawu, Yoane mumbikudi wuba.» <verse eid="MRK 11:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 11:33" />Ni hahoho bavutula ku Yesu ti: «Tuzeebi ko.» Buna Yesu wubavutudila ti: «Meno mpe nina luteela ko mu lutumu lu nani, nina hidikila misamu bemimi.»<verse eid="MRK 11:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="MRK 12" />
  <para style="s">Kingana ki bisadi bimbi bimfuba yi vinu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:33-46">Mat 21.33-46</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:9-19">Luk 20.9-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 12:1" />Yesu wutona mu bazonzila mu bingana: «Bakala dimosi dikuna mfuba yi miti mi vinu. Wuzunga yo mu lupangu, wutima bulu mu kamunanga mbutu zi vinu, mpe wutunga nzo yi kibanga yi munkengi. Mboki, wuhaana yo ku bisadi bi vinu mwanki bafutilanga yo, mpe wuyenda mu nzyetolo. <verse eid="MRK 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 12:2" />Ntangu yi nyonzokolo bu yifwana, wutambika mundongo andi wumosi ku bisadi bi mfuba yi vinu, mwanki katambula ku yawu kikunku kyandi ki mimbutu mi vinu. <verse eid="MRK 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 12:3" />Kansi yawu bamubwila, bamutuuta nkuba na bamuvutula moko na moko. <verse eid="MRK 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 12:4" />Wubwesa batambika dyaka mundongo wuhiika, kansi bamukata mu mutu na bamusafula. <verse eid="MRK 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 12:5" />Wutambika dyaka wuhiika, bamuhonda. Mboki bahiika, babingi batuuta nkuba na babingi bahonda. <verse eid="MRK 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 12:6" />Mwana andi wumosi wusaala wukatoma tya. Yandi katambika wumanunu ku yawu, mu dyambu wuta ti: “Baavumina mwana ani.” <verse eid="MRK 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 12:7" />Kansi bisadi bi mfuba yi vinu bateelasana yawu na yawu ti: “Taleeno wabyadila fwa! Yizeeno, tumuhondeeno, mwanki tubyaadila fwa.” <verse eid="MRK 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 12:8" />Bamubwila, bamuhonda na bamutuba ku mbazi yi mfuba yi vinu.<verse eid="MRK 12:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 12:9" />Yesu wubafuula ti: nki bwabu mfumu yi mfuba yi miti mi vinu kaasa e? Bu kaakwiza, mbo kahondoso bisadi bi mfuba yi miti mi vinu na mbo kahaana yo ku bantu bahiika. <verse eid="MRK 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 12:10" />Yeno lutanga ko masonama mata ti:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MRK 12:10">“Tadi dinyafuna bituungi bi nzo</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MRK 12:10">dyeka tadi divudidi mfunu. <verse eid="MRK 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 12:11" />Mfumu wusidi ti bubela bobo:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MRK 12:11">musamu wungitukulu wudi ha meso meto!”»<verse eid="MRK 12:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 12:12" />Basosa mu mukanga, kansi bayena bunkuta bu mukangu. Babakula ti mu dyambu dyawu Yesu kateela kingana bekyokyo. Bu basala mu sisa, ni bayenda.<verse eid="MRK 12:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mpaku yi Kayisali</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 22:15-22">Mat 22.15-22</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:20-26">Luk 20.20-26</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 12:13" />Batambika ku Yesu mwa ndambu yi bafalisi na bantu ba kimvuka ki Elode, mwanki bamulebikila mutambu mu mpova zi yandi bende. <verse eid="MRK 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 12:14" />Bayiza muteela ti: «Mulongisi, tuzebi ti kikedika kwe tanga na wukwe yenanga muntu bunkuta ko, mu dyambu ti ngeye wuswasikisanga bantu ko, nakwe longanga nzila yi Nzambi mu kikedika. Tuteeleti, nganunu tuu na luve mu futa mpaku yi Kayisali hoti kaani e? Tufweti futa hoti kaani e? <verse eid="MRK 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 12:15" />Kansi Yesu wubakula makani mawu ma diisu ku nsye lukaya, wubavutudila ti: bila nki luna ndebikila mutambu e? Ntwaadileeno mbongo yi kisengo yimosi, mwanki na tala yo.» <verse eid="MRK 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 12:16" />Bamutwadila yo na wubafuula ti: «Hambo kini na bisono, binani bidi e?» Bamuvutudila ti: «Bi Kayisali.» <verse eid="MRK 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 12:17" />Buna Yesu wubateela ti: «Vutuleeno bi Kayisali ku Kayisali, bi Nzambi ku Nzambi.» Yawu bayituku mu mvutu yi kabahaana.<verse eid="MRK 12:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kyuhu mu mfulukulu yi bafwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 22:23-33">Mat 22.23-33</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:27-40">Luk 20.27-40</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 12:18" />Basaduki bayiza ha ntadisi yi Yesu, yawu bakwe kwikilanga mu mfulukulu yi bafwa ko, bamufuula ti: <verse eid="MRK 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 12:19" />«Mulongisi, Mose wutusonikina ebu: “Tala ti bakala difwidi mpe sisidi mukento wulembolo sala buta mwana, mpangi andi yi bakala fweti kwela foola, mwanki kahaana nkuna ku yondowo wufwidi.” <verse eid="MRK 12:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 12:20" />Kansi kuba na babakala nsambwadi mu kimpangi kyawu. wuntete wukwela na wufwa, kasala buta mwana ko. <verse eid="MRK 12:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 12:21" />Wunzole wukwela foola na wufwa, kasala buta mwana ko. Bumosi mpe ku wumitatu, <verse eid="MRK 12:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 12:22" />Mu nsambwadi yimvimba, nakani wumosi kasala buta ko. Ku manima ma yawu bamvimba, mukento mpe wuyiza fwa. <verse eid="MRK 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 12:23" />Mu kilumbu ki mfulukulu mu bafwa, mukento wunani waaba e? Mu dyambu ti yawu nsambwadi bamukwela!» <verse eid="MRK 12:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 12:24" />Yesu wubateela ti: «Bazimbala ludi, mu dyambu ti luzebi masonama na lulendo lu Nzambi ko. <verse eid="MRK 12:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 12:25" />Mu dyambu ti, haaba mfulukulu mu bafwa, bakento na babakala baakwela ko, kansi baaba bonso zimbazi zi mazulu. <verse eid="MRK 12:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 12:26" />Mu myo mitadidi mfulukulu mu bafwa, nganunu lutanga ko mu buuku di Mose misamu mi muteela Nzambi ha vunda di mwa muti: “Meno nidi Nzambi yi Abalahami, Nzambi yi Isaaki na Nzambi yi Yakobi!” <verse eid="MRK 12:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 12:27" />Nzambi kaa Nzambi yi bafwa ko, kansi yi bamoyo. Nkatika yeno bazimbala ludi.»<verse eid="MRK 12:27" /></para>
  <para style="s">Musiku wu vudidi bunene</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 22:34-40">Mat 22.34-40</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 10:25-28">Luk 10.25-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 12:28" />Wumosi mu milongisi mi Misiku wubayuwa bu bedi sanga mpaka, mpe wuyena ti Yesu mvutu zimbote kavutula ku basaduki. Wufinama, mpe wumufuula ti: «Nkye mwina wuu wuntete mu mina mimvimba e?» <verse eid="MRK 12:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 12:29" />Yesu wumuvutudila ti: «Mwina wuntete, ni ewu: “Isaeli, yuwa! Mfumu Nzambi eto, ni yandi kaka wuu Mfumu. <verse eid="MRK 12:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 12:30" />Zola Mfumu Nzambi aku mu mutima aku wumvimba, mu mwela aku wumvimba, mu madyela maku mamvimba, mpe mu ngolo zaku zimvimba.” <verse eid="MRK 12:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 12:31" />Wunzole ni ewu: “zola mfinangani aku bonso ngebende.” Kuu mina mihiika mivudidi mfunu ko na myamimyole bemimi.» <verse eid="MRK 12:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 12:32" />Mulongisi wu Misiku wumuteela ti: «Mulongisi, nkatika bumbote zonzidi! Kikedika teedi ti Nzambi yimosi kaka yidi, kuu Nzambi yihiika ko. <verse eid="MRK 12:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 12:33" />Zola Mfumu Nzambi aku mu mutima aku wumvimba, [mu madyela maku mamvimba] na mu ngolo zaku zimvimba, mpe zola mfinangani aku bonso ngebende. Mina bemimi mivudidi mfunu na minkayulu mye yoka kibulu kimvimba, mpe na minkayulu mimvimba mye yoka bibulu.» <verse eid="MRK 12:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 12:34" />Yesu bu kayena ti mu ndwenga kahaanina mvutu, wumuteela ti: «Siidi kitatu na Kimfumu ki Nzambi ko.» Ka muntu wubwesa muzika dyaka byuhu.<verse eid="MRK 12:34" /></para>
  <para style="s">Klisto na Davidi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 22:41-46">Mat 22.41-46</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:41-44">Luk 20.41-44</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 12:35" />Yesu bu kedi longanga mu nzo-Nzambi, wufuula ti: «Bwedi milongisi mi Misiku milendi teela ti Klisto mwana wu Davidi kadi e? <verse eid="MRK 12:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 12:36" />Davidi yandi bende muntwadusulu yi Mpeve Yilongo, wuta ti:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 12:36">“Mfumu Nzambi wuta ku Mfumu ani ti:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 12:36">Yiza zakala ha lweka lu lubakala lwani,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 12:36">Natee bu nasa ti mitantu myaku miba bitentokolo bi bitambi byaku.”<verse eid="MRK 12:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 12:37" />Tala ti Davidi wuna mutumisina “Mfumu”, bwedi kalendi bwesa bela dyaka mwana andi e?»</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 12:37">Mpumbu yiyinene yi bantu yedi mu yuwa mu kyese.<verse eid="MRK 12:37" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu wusemba milongisi mi Misiku</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 23:1-36">Mat 23.1-36</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:45-47">Luk 20.45-47</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 12:38" />Mu ndongosolo andi Yesu wubateela ti: «Kebeeno kweno na milongisi mi Misiku, batiidi mu kwe yungingi mu mazwele mamala na benda bahekingi mbote mu byanzala, <verse eid="MRK 12:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 12:39" />bakwe tyanga mu sola bibuka bintete mu zinzo zi lusambulu zi Bayudayo na bibuka bi buzitu mu ndambisa. <verse eid="MRK 12:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 12:40" />Bakwe zyonanga bima bimvimba bi mafoola na bakwe sanga zinsambulu zizila mu kiyenikisa. Baatambula mfundusu yi hyokidi kitezo.»<verse eid="MRK 12:40" /></para>
  <para style="s">Munkayulu wu foola di muwelo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 21:1-4">Luk 21.1-4</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 12:41" />Yesu wuzakala mu nzo-Nzambi ha ntendo kima ki bakwe haaninanga minkayulu, wuyena bwedi mpumbu yi bantu yedi haaninanga mbongo. Mvwama zizingi zedi haananga mbongo zizingi. <verse eid="MRK 12:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 12:42" />Foola dimosi di muwelo dituula momo mbongo zole zi kisengo zilembolo ba mfunu. <verse eid="MRK 12:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 12:43" />Buna Yesu wutumisa milongoki myandi mpe wubateela ti: «Kedika nina luteela, mu bamvimba foola bedidi di muwelo divudidi tuula mu kima ki bakwe haaninanga minkayulu. <verse eid="MRK 12:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 12:44" />Mu dyambu ti bamvimba baheeni mbongo zilembolo ba nawu mfunu, kansi yandi, mu bumputu bwandi, tudidi zimvimba zibedi nandi nsatu mu zinga.»<verse eid="MRK 12:44" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="MRK 13" />
  <para style="s">Mwangusunu yi nzo-Nzambi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:1-2">Mat 24.1-2</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:5-6">Luk 21.5-6</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 13:1" />Yesu bu kaduuka mu nzo-Nzambi, wumosi mu milongoki myandi wumuteela ti: «Mulongisi, taleeti kwaku! Nkye kitoko ki matadi bemama, mpe nkye miyimba nzo!» <verse eid="MRK 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 13:2" />Kansi Yesu wumuteela ti: «Wuna yena miyimba nzo bemimi e? Kwaabwesa sala kaa tadi dimosi ha yulu tadi nandi ko, bimvimba byaamana mwangana.»<verse eid="MRK 13:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mpasi na mfyetokoso zina kwiza ku mutwala</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:3-14">Mat 24.3-14</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:7-19">Luk 21.7-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 13:3" />Yesu wuba wuzakala ha yulu mulandu wu Olive mpe wuba wutadisa ku nzo-Nzambi. Petelo, Yoane, Zaki na Andele bamufuula ha yawu hiika ti: <verse eid="MRK 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 13:4" />«Tuteeleti nkye kilumbu misamu bemimi myaatula, mpe mu nkye kidimbu baazabila ti mimvimba bemimi myaahilama e?»<verse eid="MRK 13:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 13:5" />Yesu wubavutudila ti: «Kebeeno kweno! Muntu ka luhukumunandi ko. <verse eid="MRK 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 13:6" />Mu dyambu ti babingi baakwiza mu nkumbu ani, na baaluteela ti: “Meno nii Klisto!” Na bantu babingi baahukumuna. <verse eid="MRK 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 13:7" />Lwaayuwa bu bazonzila zimvita na manyungu-nyungu ma zimvita, luyenandi bunkuta ko. Misamu mimvimba bemyomyo mifweti hilama, kansi yaaba, mpe nsukunu yi nza ko. <verse eid="MRK 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 13:8" />Bantu ba nsi yimosi baanwanisa bantu ba nsi yihiika, bantu bantinu yimosi baanwanisa bantu bantinu yihiika. Mu bizunga bibingi butoto bwaazakama na malema maaba. Misamu bemyomyo myaaba bonso ntonono yi misongo mi mukento weka lukufi mu buta. <verse eid="MRK 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 13:9" />Kebeeno kweno, mu dyambu ti bantu baalunata mu zinzo zi lufundusu, na baaluzuba bikoti mu zinzo zi lusambulu zi Bayudayo. Baalufundisa ha ntadisi yi zintinu na ha ntadisi yi minyaadi mu dyambu dyani, mpe kyaaba kimbangi ki lwaanteela ha ntadisi awu. <verse eid="MRK 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 13:10" />Kansi Musamu Wumbote wufweti teka samunu ku bantu ba nsi zimvimba. <verse eid="MRK 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 13:11" />Bu baalunata mu kwe luyekola, lutekandi kikwamisa ko mu misamu mi lwaazonza. Kansi teeno mpova zi baluhaana mu kilokola bekyokyo kwandi, mu dyambu ti ka ku yeno ko zaafuma, kansi ku Mpeve Yilongo.<verse eid="MRK 13:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 13:12" />Mpangi yaayekola mpangi andi bamuhonda na tata waasa bumosi ku mwana andi, baala baanangumukina bibuti byawu, na baabahondisa. <verse eid="MRK 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 13:13" />Bantu bamvimba baalubela mu dyambu di nkumbu ani. Kansi wonso waatatamana natee ku nsukunu, waavuuka.<verse eid="MRK 13:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mpasi zi ngitukulu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:15-25">Mat 24.15-25</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:20-24">Luk 21.20-24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 13:14" />Mu ntangu yi lwaayena “kimwangisi kinsisi” [kyo kizonzila mumbikudi Danyeli], kizakadi ha kibuka ki kaketi lembolo ba. – Bika muntu wuna tanga kabakula! – Buna yobobo baaba ku Yuda bafweti tinina ku milandu, <verse eid="MRK 13:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 13:15" />yondowo waaba ku yulu muludi wu nzo kakulumukandi mu kwiza bonga bima bii mu kati di nzo andi, <verse eid="MRK 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 13:16" />na yondowo waaba ku mfuba, kavutukandi ku nzo andi mu kwiza bonga kiyunga kyandi. <verse eid="MRK 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 13:17" />Mu bilumbu bebyobyo, nkye mpila kyadi ku bakento baaba na mazimi na baanwika baala mabene! <verse eid="MRK 13:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 13:18" />Sambileeno yilembolo ba mu nsungi yi kyozi kingolo! <verse eid="MRK 13:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 13:19" />Mu dyambu ti, mu bilumbu bebyobyo, mpasi zizingi zaaba zi tuteka lembolo yena, kutonina ku mbadukulu, Nzambi yi kahidika nza, natee mu ntangu beyiyi, mpe mpasi zibobo zaabwesa ba ko. <verse eid="MRK 13:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 13:20" />Tala ti Nzambi kabonga nzengolo ko mu kufika bilumbu bebyobyo, kunaani muntu wuketi vuuka. Kansi wukufika byo mu dyambu di yobobo ba kasoola.<verse eid="MRK 13:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 13:21" />Tala ti muntu wuluteedidi ti: “Taleeno Klisto ewu eha!” Hoti “Ehana kadi!” Lumukwikilandi ko. <verse eid="MRK 13:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 13:22" />Mu dyambu ti zi klisto zi luvunu na mimbikudi mi luvunu myaatelama, baahidika bidimbu na bimangu bingitukulu muhukumuna mpe, tala ti bulendi ba, yobobo Nzambi bakasoola. <verse eid="MRK 13:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 13:23" />Kebeeno kweno! Meno nalulwengisi mu mimvimba.<verse eid="MRK 13:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nyizulu yi Mwana muntu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:29-31">Mat 24.29-31</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:25-28">Luk 21.25-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 13:24" />Kansi mu bilumbu bebyobyo kwandi, ku manima ma mpasi zibubu, ntangu yaabwesa lezima ko, ngonda yaabwesa kyenzola ko, <verse eid="MRK 13:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 13:25" />na zimbwetete ku yulu zaasotoka na bima bii na lulendo mu mazulu byaaningana. <verse eid="MRK 13:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 13:26" />Ni hahoho baayenina Mwana Muntu, wuna kwiza mu matuti mu lulendo lwandi lumvimba na nkembo andi yimvimba. <verse eid="MRK 13:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 13:27" />Buna waatambika mbazi zandi na waayonzika yobobo baakasoodidi mu ndambu ziya zi nza, baafuma ku sukina nza natee ku sukina yulu.<verse eid="MRK 13:27" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kingana ki muti wu fike</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:32-35">Mat 24.32-35</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:29-33">Luk 21.29-33</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 13:28" />Bika kingana ki muti wu fike ki lulonga: bu lwatumbu yena bintala byandi byeka bimamba na makaya mandi matonini mu sasa, luzebi ti ntangu yi ntombo yeka lukufi. <verse eid="MRK 13:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 13:29" />Bumosi mpe ku yeno, bu lwaayena misamu bemyomyo ti mitudidi, zabeeno ti Mwana Muntu weka lukufi, na weka ha myelo myeno. <verse eid="MRK 13:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 13:30" />Kedika nina luteela, mbandu beyiyi yaahyoka ko tala ti mimvimba mitudidi ko. <verse eid="MRK 13:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 13:31" />Yulu na butoto byaahyoka, kansi Mambu mani maahyoka ko.<verse eid="MRK 13:31" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kilumbu kyaakwiza Mwana Muntu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:36-44">Mat 24.36-44</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 13:32" />Mu dyambu ditadidi kilumbu na kilokola, ka muntu ko zebi, ka zimbazi zi mazulu ko, ka Mwana ko, kansi Tata kaka zebi.<verse eid="MRK 13:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 13:33" />Kebeeno kweno! Kayeeno meso mu dyambu ti luzebi ko nkye ntangu kilokola kyaakwiza. <verse eid="MRK 13:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 13:34" />Kyaaba bonso muntu wumosi, wuna kwenda ku nzyetolo, sisidi nzo andi mu moko ma mindongo myandi. Mpe heeni ku muntu-muntu kisalu kyandi ki kasala mpe teedidi ku munkengi wu mwelo kakaya meso. <verse eid="MRK 13:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 13:35" />Ni hahoho, kayeeno meso mu dyambu ti luzebi kilokola kyaakwiza mfumu yi nzo ko: mu mpimpa, hoti mu kati-kati di mpimpa, hoti mu ntangu yikwe kubanga zinsusu, hoti mu mene. <verse eid="MRK 13:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 13:36" />Bu kaakwiza, kizandi kalubwana balambalala. <verse eid="MRK 13:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 13:37" />Misamu bemimi mi nina luteela, kuyeno bamvimba nina teela myo: Kayeeno meso!»<verse eid="MRK 13:37" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="MRK 14" />
  <para style="s">Bakotila Yesu manenga</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:1-5">Mat 26.1-5</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:1-2">Luk 22.1-2</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 11:45-53">Yoa 11.45-53</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 14:1" />Bilumbu byole bisala mu sa mukembo wu Pake, mpe wu mampa ma kiputi kilembolo vimba. Mfumu zinganga-Nzambi na milongisi mi Misiku basosa bwedi bakangila Yesu mu madyela, mwanki ba muhondisa. <verse eid="MRK 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 14:2" />Kansi bata ti: «Tumukangandi mu ntangu yi mukembo, mwanki mukangu wulembolo nangumuka.»<verse eid="MRK 14:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mukento wubulumuna Yesu mananasi ha yulu mutu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:6-13">Mat 26.6-13</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 12:1-8">Yoa 12.1-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 14:3" />Yesu bu kaba ku Betani, ku nzo yi Simoni, yondowo wubeela kimbevo ki bwazi, bu kaba ha meza, mukento wumosi wuyiza kota na mbwata yi alabati yifuluka mu mananasi ma nale mamfuku yimbote na mantalu yiyingi, malembolo vwatana na kima kihiika. Wubula mbwata na wubulumuna mananasi ha yulu mutu wu Yesu. <verse eid="MRK 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 14:4" />Mwa bantu bahiika baba hoho bafwema na bata ti: «Bila nki mu fukisa mananasi e? <verse eid="MRK 14:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 14:5" />Nganunu tuyadikidi mananasi bemama mu ntalu yi hyokidi nkamatatu (300) zi mbongo zi bisengo, mpe bahaana zo ku bamputu!» Mboki, ni bafwemina mukento bewowo. <verse eid="MRK 14:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 14:6" />Kansi Yesu wubateela ti: «Mubikeeno! Bila nki luna mukwamisina e? Musamu wu kampidikidi nkatika wumbote wudi. <verse eid="MRK 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 14:7" />Mu dyambu ti bamputu baaba neeno ntangu zimvimba, mpe lulendi bahidikila misamu mimbote ntangu zimvimba bonso bu lutidi, kansi meno naaba neeno ntangu zimvimba ko. <verse eid="MRK 14:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 14:8" />Misamu mi kahidikidi ni myo mi kalendidi mu hidika, mpe kusidi mananasi mu nitu ani, mu kubika nzikulu ani. <verse eid="MRK 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 14:9" />Kedika nina luteela, mu nza yimvimba, konso ku baasamuna musamu wumbote bewuwu, mbo bazonzila mpe musamu wuhidikidi mukento bewuwu mu mubambukila moyo.»<verse eid="MRK 14:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yuda wusosa mu yekola Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:14-16">Mat 26.14-16</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:3-6">Luk 22.3-6</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 14:10" />Yuda Isikalyoti, wumosi mu milongoki kumi na myole, wuyenda ku zinkuluntu zi zinganga-Nzambi mu bayekodila Yesu. <verse eid="MRK 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 14:11" />Bu bayuwa bobo, bayangalala, mboki bamusila nsilulu ye muhaana mbongo. Ni kedi sosa hwahwa mu muyekola.<verse eid="MRK 14:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Milongoki mi kubika bindya bi Pake</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:17-19">Mat 26.17-19</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:7-13">Luk 22.7-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 14:12" />Kilumbu kintete ki mukembo wu mampa ma kiputi kilembolo vimba, kilumbu bekyokyo ki bakwe haananga munkayulu we yoka wu mwana dimeme mu dyambu di mukembo wu Pake, milongoki miyiza fuula Yesu ti: «Kwedi tiidi twenda tukukubikila bindya bi Pake e?» <verse eid="MRK 14:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 14:13" />Buna Yesu wutambika milongoki myandi myole na wubateela ti: «Yendeeno ku mbanza, lwaabwana bakala dimosi di nakwe naati sanga di mamba ha yulu mutu. Mulandeeno <verse eid="MRK 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 14:14" />natee mu nzo yi kakwe kota, mboki teeleeno mfumu yi nzo ti: “Mulongisi ebu kateedi: Kwedi kuu kihinga ki naadila bindya bi Pake na milongoki myani e?” <verse eid="MRK 14:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 14:15" />Waalulonka ku yulu yi nzo yi kibanga, kihinga kikinene kikubuku. Ni mwamomo lwaatukubikila bindya bi Pake.» <verse eid="MRK 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 14:16" />Milongoki miyenda na mitula ku mbanza, mpe bayenda bwana misamu bonso bu kabateedila myo na bakubika bindya bi Pake.<verse eid="MRK 14:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu wudya bindya bi Pake na milongoki myandi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:20-30">Mat 26.20-30</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:14-23">Luk 22.14-23</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:21-26">Yoa 13.21-26</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 11:23-25">1 Ko 11.23-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 14:17" />Mpimpa buyitula, Yesu wuyiza na milongoki kumi na myole. <verse eid="MRK 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 14:18" />Bu baba ha meza na bu bedi dyanga, Yesu wuta ti: «Kedika nina luteela, wumosi mu yeno wuna dya ha kimosi naani, waanyekola.» <verse eid="MRK 14:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 14:19" />Batona mu yena kyadi na wumosi-wumosi wumufuula ti: «Kadi meno e?» <verse eid="MRK 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 14:20" />Wubavutudila ti: «Ni wumosi mu kumi na myole, yondowo wuna tuula ha kimosi naani kooko mu ndonga. <verse eid="MRK 14:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 14:21" />Mwana Muntu wuna kwenda bonso bu wudi wusonama mu yandi. Kansi nkya mpila kyadi ku muntu bewowo waamuyekola. Buba bumbote ku muntu bewowo mulembolo butuka.»<verse eid="MRK 14:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 14:22" />Mu ntangu yibedi dya, Yesu wubonga dimpa, bu kamana vutula matondo, wubukuna dyo na wubahaana dyo, mpe wuta ti: «Bongeeno, yi ni nitu ani.» <verse eid="MRK 14:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 14:23" />Mboki wubonga mbungu, bu kamana vutula matondo, wubahaana yo, mpe bamvimba banwa yo. <verse eid="MRK 14:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 14:24" />Yesu wubateela ti: «Ma ni menga mani, menga ma luwawanu [lumoona], matengolo mu dyambu di bantu babingi. <verse eid="MRK 14:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 14:25" />Kedika nina luteela, naabwesa nwa dyaka vinu ko, natee kilumbu ki naanwa vinu dinsonso mu Kimfumu ki Nzambi.» <verse eid="MRK 14:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 14:26" />Bu bamana yimbila mikunga, baduuka mu kwenda ku ndambusu yi mulandu wu Olive.<verse eid="MRK 14:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu wuzabikisa ti Petelo waamubisa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:31-35">Mat 26.31-35</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:31-34">Luk 22.31-34</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:36-38">Yoa 13.36-38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 14:27" />Yesu wubateela ti: «[Mu mpimpa beyiyi kwandi], yeno bamvimba lwaabwa, mu dyambu ti wusonama: “Naahonda mumvungi wu mameme, mpe kamba dimvimba di mameme dyaamwangana.” <verse eid="MRK 14:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 14:28" />Kansi bu naafuluka mu bafwa, naalutekidila ku kizunga ki Ngalili.» <verse eid="MRK 14:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 14:29" />Petelo wumuteela ti: «Kati bamvimba bakusisidi, meno naakusisa ko!» <verse eid="MRK 14:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 14:30" />Yesu wumuteela ti: «Kedika nina kuteela: Mu mpimpa yi bubedidi kwandi, tekila nsusu yikuba nkumbu yinzole, ngeye waambisa nkumbu tatu.» <verse eid="MRK 14:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 14:31" />Kansi Petelo wutatamana musingisa ti: «Kati kufwa naasa naku, meno ndendi sala kubisa ko!» Mpe bamvimba bwabobo bazonzila.<verse eid="MRK 14:31" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu wusambila ku Ngetesemane</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:36-46">Mat 26.36-46</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:39-46">Luk 22.39-46</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 14:32" />Batula ha kibuka ki bakwe tumisinanga ti Ngetesemane, na Yesu wuteela milongoki myandi ti: «Zakaleeno ehaha, meno bu nina kwenda ku sambila.» <verse eid="MRK 14:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 14:33" />Wunata Petelo, Zaki na Yoane. Mpe wutona muyena kyadi na kingongo, <verse eid="MRK 14:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 14:34" />mpe wubateela ti: «Mutima ani wufulukidi mu kyadi mu dyambu di lufwa, zakaleeno ehaha na kayeeno meso.» <verse eid="MRK 14:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 14:35" />Mboki wuyenda mwa kitatu, wubwa ha nsi na wusambila, mwanki tala ti bulendi ba, kilokola bekyokyo kimutatukila. <verse eid="MRK 14:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 14:36" />Wuta ti: «Aba, Tata, ngeye wulembananga dyambu ko, nkatudidila mbungu beyiyi yi mpasi. Ka bu natiidi meno ko, kansi bu wutiidi ngeye.» <verse eid="MRK 14:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 14:37" />Bu kavutuka ku milongoki myandi, wubabwana balambalala, na wuteela Petelo ti: «Simoni, lambaladi e? Lembakani mu kaya meso ka mu mwa kilokola kimosi e? <verse eid="MRK 14:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 14:38" />Kayeeno meso na sambileeno mwanki lu lembolo bwa mu ntontolo. Mpeve yii na kinzodila, kansi nitu yii na lebakani.» <verse eid="MRK 14:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 14:39" />Wuyenda dyaka mwa kitatu na wuvutukila lusambulu belolo. <verse eid="MRK 14:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 14:40" />Mboki wuvutuka dyaka ku milongoki myandi na wubabwana balambala, meso mawu maba mavwembalala mu tolo. Na bazaba ko nki balendi muteela. <verse eid="MRK 14:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 14:41" />Bu kavutuka mu nkumbu yi tatu, wubateela ti: «Lutatamani kweno mu bwa tolo na luna huma kweno e? Bwabu bulungidi! Kilokola kifweni, Mwana Muntu wabayekodi bwabu mu moko ma minsumuki. <verse eid="MRK 14:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 14:42" />Telameeno, twendeeno! Yondowo wuna nyekola tudidi!»<verse eid="MRK 14:42" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bakengi Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:47-56">Mat 26.47-56</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:47-53">Luk 22.47-53</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:3-12">Yoa 18.3-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 14:43" />Kakimanisina mu zonza ko, mpe Yuda, wumosi mu milongoki kumi na myole, wutula na mpumbu yi bantu yiba na mbele zi zimvita, mpe na bibono. Babatambika ku zimfumu zinganga-nzambi, milongisi mi Misiku na zinkuluntu zi Bayudayo. <verse eid="MRK 14:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 14:44" />Yuda, yondowo wedi yekola Yesu, wubahaana kidimbu eki: «Yondowo wu naafiba ni yandowo, mukangeeno na munateeno, mpe tomeeno kwe mukengi.» <verse eid="MRK 14:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 14:45" />Yuda bu katumbu tula, wufinama ha bela Yesu na wumuteela ti: «Mulongisi!» Na wumufiba. <verse eid="MRK 14:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 14:46" />Buna babwila Yesu, ni bamukanga. <verse eid="MRK 14:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 14:47" />Wumosi mu yobobo baba hoho, wuduukisa mbele yi mvita na wukata mundongo wu mfumu yi nganga-Nzambi, mpe wumuzenga kutu. <verse eid="MRK 14:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MRK 14:48" />Mboki Yesu wubateela ti: «Kadi kimpumbulu nidi, mwanki lwiza lunkanga na mbele zimvita na bibono e? <verse eid="MRK 14:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MRK 14:49" />Bilumbu bimvimba nabedi neeno mu nzo-Nzambi mu lulonga na lusosidi mu mbwila ko. Kansi bika bubela bobo, mwanki Masonama malunga.» <verse eid="MRK 14:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MRK 14:50" />Buna milongoki mimvimba misala musisa na miwoka.<verse eid="MRK 14:50" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="MRK 14:51" />Toko dimosi diba dilwata mulele wumpamba, dyedi kwe landi Yesu. Bamukanga, <verse eid="MRK 14:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="MRK 14:52" />kansi wusala loosa mulele na wuwoka mpene.<verse eid="MRK 14:52" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu ha ntadisi yi bakuluntu ba Bayudayo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:57-68">Mat 26.57-68</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:54-55">Luk 22.54-55</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 22:63-71">63-71</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:13-14">Yoa 18.13-14</ref>,<ref loc="JHN 18:19-24">19-24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="MRK 14:53" />Banata Yesu ku mfumu yi zinganga-Nzambi, kumana kutakana zimfumu zi zinganga-Nzambi zimvimba, milongisi mi Misiku na zinkuluntu zi Bayudayo. <verse eid="MRK 14:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="MRK 14:54" />Petelo wuba kitatu na wedi kwe mulandi natee ku nzo yi mfumu yi zinganga-Nzambi. Wuzakala ha mbazi mu kati di lupangu na minkebi na wedi yetila ha ntendo tiya. <verse eid="MRK 14:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="MRK 14:55" />Zimfumu zinganga-Nzambi na kimvuka ki zinkuluntu zi Bayudayo, basosa kimbangi mu Yesu mwanki bamuzengila lufwa, kansi babaka kyo ko. <verse eid="MRK 14:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="MRK 14:56" />Bantu babingi bayiza ta bimbangi bi luvunu mu dyambu dyandi, kansi bimbangi byawu byedi dedakana ko. <verse eid="MRK 14:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="MRK 14:57" />Mwa ndambu yi bantu batelama mu muteela kimbangi ki luvunu na bata ti: <verse eid="MRK 14:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="MRK 14:58" />«Tumuyuwa bu kedi ta ti: “Ndendi bula nzo-Nzambi beyiyi yitungu mu moko ma bantu, mpe mu bilumbu bitatu, ndendi tunga dyaka yihiika yalembolo ba yitungu mu moko ma bantu.”» <verse eid="MRK 14:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="MRK 14:59" />Kansi, kaati mu mpova bezozo zibata, kimbangi kyawu kiba kidedakana ko. <verse eid="MRK 14:59" /><verse number="60" style="v" sid="MRK 14:60" />Mfumu yi zinganga-Nzambi wutelama ha kati di bundu na wufuula Yesu ti: «Wuna vutula mvutu mu bimbangi bi bana ta mu dyambu dyaku ko e?» <verse eid="MRK 14:60" /><verse number="61" style="v" sid="MRK 14:61" />Kansi Yesu wuba naswii na kavutula dyambu ko. Mfumu yi zinganga-Nzambi wumufuula dyaka ti: «Ngeye ni Klisto, Mwana wu Nzambi yi Lusakumunu e?» <verse eid="MRK 14:61" /><verse number="62" style="v" sid="MRK 14:62" />Yesu wumuvutudila ti: «Ninga, ni meno! Mpe lwaayena Mwana Muntu wuzakadi ha lubakala lu Nzambi yi lulendo, wuna kwiza mu matuti maa ku yulu.» <verse eid="MRK 14:62" /><verse number="63" style="v" sid="MRK 14:63" />Mboki mfumu yi zinganga-Nzambi wutumbu kakuna binkutu byandi na wuta ti: «Tusidi dyaka na nsatu yi zimbangi ko! <verse eid="MRK 14:63" /><verse number="64" style="v" sid="MRK 14:64" />Luyudi bwedi kasafudidi Nzambi. Bwedi luna banzila e?» Bamvimba bavutula ti ku mbedi kadi na fweti fwa.<verse eid="MRK 14:64" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="65" style="v" sid="MRK 14:65" />Mwa ndambu yi bantu bedi mulobola mante, bamufuka luse, bamuwinda zinkome na bedi muteela ti: «Bikula!» Minkebi mpe myedi mukaata zimbata.<verse eid="MRK 14:65" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Petelo wubisa Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:69-75">Mat 26.69-75</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:54-62">Luk 22.54-62</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:15-18">Yoa 18.15-18</ref>,<ref loc="JHN 18:25-27">25-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" sid="MRK 14:66" />Petelo wuba ku nsi, ku kati di lupangu, kisadi kimosi ki mukento ki mfumu yi zinganga-Nzambi kiyiza. <verse eid="MRK 14:66" /><verse number="67" style="v" sid="MRK 14:67" />Bu kayena Petelo wuba wuzakala ha ntendo tiya, wumusungimina na wumuteela ti: «Ngeye mpe, na Yesu mwisi-Nazaleti lubedingi.» <verse eid="MRK 14:67" /><verse number="68" style="v" sid="MRK 14:68" />Wubisa bu kata ti: «Nzebi ko, nina bakula ko myo ngeye mitiidi mu ta.» Mboki wuduuka, wuyenda ba ha mwelo wu lupangu. [Nsusu ni yikuba.] <verse eid="MRK 14:68" /><verse number="69" style="v" sid="MRK 14:69" />Kansi kisadi ki mukento bekyokyo bu kamuyena, wutona dyaka mu ta ku yobobo baba hoho ti: «Muntu bewuwu, nkatika wumosi mu yawu kadi.» <verse eid="MRK 14:69" /><verse number="70" style="v" sid="MRK 14:70" />Petelo wubisa dyaka. Ku manima, yobobo baba hoho bateela dyaka Petelo ti: «Ngeye mpe wudi wumosi ha kati dyawu, mu dyambu ti mwisi-Ngalili wudi.» <verse eid="MRK 14:70" /><verse number="71" style="v" sid="MRK 14:71" />Buna Petelo wutona mu dya ndefi ti: «Bika Nzambi kansemba, tala ti kuhuna nina sa! Kedika, meno nzebi muntu bewuwu wu luna zonzila ko.» <verse eid="MRK 14:71" /><verse number="72" style="v" sid="MRK 14:72" />Hansi na nsi, nsusu yikuba nkumbu yinzole na Petelo wubambuka moyo mu musamu wumuteela Yesu ti: «Teekila nsusu yikuba nkumbu zole, waambisa nkumbu zitatu.» Ni katona mu dila.<verse eid="MRK 14:72" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="MRK 15" />
  <para style="s1">Banata Yesu ku Pilatu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:1-2">Mat 27.1-2</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 27:11-14">11-14</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:1-5">Luk 23.1-5</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:28-38">Yoa 18.28-38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 15:1" />Mu mene na mene, zimfumu zinganga-Nzambi na zinkuluntu zi Bayudayo, milongisi mi Misiku na kimvuka kimvimba ki zinkuluntu zi Bayudayo zikutakana. Bu zimana bindika Yesu misinga, zimunata, mpe zimuyekola ku Pilatu. <verse eid="MRK 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 15:2" />Pilatu wumufuula ti: «Ngeye ni ntinu yi Bayudayo e?» Yesu wumuvutudila ti: «Ngeye wuna ta wo.» <verse eid="MRK 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 15:3" />Zimfumu zinganga-Nzambi zimufunda mu misamu mimingi. <verse eid="MRK 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 15:4" />Pilatu wumufuula dyaka ti: «Wuna vutula dyambu ko e? Wuna yuwa misamu mimvimba mi bana kufundila!» <verse eid="MRK 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 15:5" />Kansi Yesu kavutula dyambu ko, mpe Pilatu wutoma yituku.<verse eid="MRK 15:5" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bazengila Yesu lufwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:15-26">Mat 27.15-26</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:13-25">Luk 23.13-25</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:39-19:16">Yoa 18.39–19.16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 15:6" />Kadi mukembo wu Pake, Pilatu wuba na kifu kye yambulanga nkole yimosi, yo ya lomba mukangu. <verse eid="MRK 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 15:7" />Kuba na muntu wumosi nkumbu andi Balabase, wuba mu boloko na bimpumbulu bihiika mu dyambu ti bahonda muntu mu ntangu yi nangumuka mukangu. <verse eid="MRK 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 15:8" />Mukangu wutomboka ku nzo yi Pilatu na wutona mu mulomba mu ngolo musamu wu kedi bahidikilanga bonso buba kifu kyandi. <verse eid="MRK 15:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 15:9" />Buna Pilatu wuvutula ti: «Lutiidi na luyambudila ntinu yi Bayudayo e?» <verse eid="MRK 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 15:10" />Wuzaba ti, ni mu dyambu di musoki zimfumu zinganga-Nzambi ziyekodila Yesu. <verse eid="MRK 15:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 15:11" />Kansi zimfumu zinganga-Nzambi zisindisila mukangu, mwanki Pilatu kabayambudila Balabase. <verse eid="MRK 15:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 15:12" />Pilatu wuvutukila mu bafuula dyaka ti: «Nki lutiidi nasa ku yondowo wu lukwe tumisinanga ti ntinu yi Bayudayo e?» <verse eid="MRK 15:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 15:13" />Balookana dyaka ti: «Mukoma ha kulunsi!» <verse eid="MRK 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 15:14" />Pilatu wubateela ti: «Nkye musamu wumbi kasiidi e?» Kansi batatamana mu lookana mu ngolo ti: «Mukoma ha kulunsi!» <verse eid="MRK 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 15:15" />Pilatu bu katya mu yangidika mpumbu yi bantu, wubayambudila Balabase. Bu kamana zubusu Yesu bikoti, wumuyekola mwanki baamukoma ha kulunsi.<verse eid="MRK 15:15" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mbulu-mbulu zi vweza Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:27-31">Mat 27.27-31</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:2-3">Yoa 19.2-3</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 15:16" />Mbulu-mbulu zinata Yesu mu kati di lupangu lu nzo yi munyadi. Zikutikisa kabu dimvimba di zimbulu-mbulu. <verse eid="MRK 15:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 15:17" />Zimulwika kiyunga kimbwaki, mpe zisyeta mpu yi nsende yi kintinu na zimutuula yo ha yulu mutu. <verse eid="MRK 15:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 15:18" />Mboki zitona mu muhaana mbote mu ta ti: «Mbote aku, ntinu yi Bayudayo!» <verse eid="MRK 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 15:19" />Zedi muzubanga dyadya ku mutu na zedi mulobolanga mante. Mboki ni zedi fukamanga na zedi kondamanga ha ntadisi andi. <verse eid="MRK 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 15:20" />Bu bamana muvweza, bamukatula kiyunga kimbwaki na bamuvutudila binkutu byandi. Ni bamunata ku mbazi yi mbanza mu kwe mukoma ha kulunsi.<verse eid="MRK 15:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bakoma Yesu ha kulunsi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:32-44">Mat 27.32-44</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:26-43">Luk 23.26-43</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:17-27">Yoa 19.17-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 15:21" />Muntu wumosi wu mbanza yi Sileni, nkumbu andi Simoni, tata di Alezandeli na di Lufusi, wufuma ku mfuba. Zimbulu-mbulu zi mukwika mu nata kulunsi di Yesu. <verse eid="MRK 15:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 15:22" />Zimbulu-mbulu zinata Yesu ha kibuka ki nkumbu Ngolongota, mbangudulu ti: «Kikonzongolo ki mutu». <verse eid="MRK 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 15:23" />Batya mu muhaana vinu di bavwatisa na mile, kansi Yesu wubisa dyo. <verse eid="MRK 15:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 15:24" />Bamukoma ha kulunsi. Mboki bata hwadi mu kabana binkutu byandi, mu zaba nki kadi muntu kaa baka. <verse eid="MRK 15:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 15:25" />Kiba kilokola kivwa mu mene bu bakoma Yesu ha kulunsi. <verse eid="MRK 15:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 15:26" />Ha yulu kulunsi dyandi, basonika kibila ki bamukomina na basonika ti: «Ntinu yi Bayudayo.»<verse eid="MRK 15:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 15:27" />Bakoma ha kimosi na Yesu bimpumbulu byole, wumosi ku kooko ku lubakala na wuhiika ku kooko ku lumoso.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 15:27">[<verse eid="MRK 15:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 15:28" />Bwabobo misamu mita mimbikudi miyendila detila: «Bamutanga ha kati di bimpumbulu.»] <verse eid="MRK 15:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 15:29" />Mimpyoka nzila myedi tuka Yesu, myedi ningisa mitu mu ta ti: «Ee! Ngeye waabula nzo-Nzambi na waatunga yo dyaka mu bilumbu bitatu, <verse eid="MRK 15:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 15:30" />kivuukisa ngebende mpe kulumuka bwabu ha kulunsi!» <verse eid="MRK 15:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 15:31" />Bumosi ku zimfumu zinganga-Nzambi na milongisi mi Misiku, bayodila Yesu mpe batelasana yawu na yawu ti: «Wuvuukisa bahiika, kansi kalendi kivuukisa yandi bende ko! <verse eid="MRK 15:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 15:32" />Bika Klisto, ntinu yi Isaeli, ka kulumuka bwabu ha kulunsi! Mwanki tumuyena na tumukwikila.» Yobobo babakoma nandi ha kulunsi, bedi mutukanga mpe.<verse eid="MRK 15:32" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Lufwa lu Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:45-56">Mat 27.45-56</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:44-49">Luk 23.44-49</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:28-30">Yoa 19.28-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 15:33" />Mu ntangu ambata, tombe kiyiza bwa mu nsi yimvimba natee mu kilokola kitatu ki manima ma ntangu ambata. <verse eid="MRK 15:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 15:34" />Mu kilokola kitatu ku manima ma ntangu ambata, Yesu wulooka mu ngolo ti: «Eloyi, Eloyi, lema sabakatani e?» Mpila mosi ti: «Nzambi ani, Nzambi ani, bila nki wunsisidi e?»<verse eid="MRK 15:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 15:35" />Mwa ndambu yi bantu baba hoho bamuyuwa na bata ti: «Yuweno, Eliya kana tumisa!» <verse eid="MRK 15:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 15:36" />Wumosi mu yawu, wunooka mu kwe bonga mwa musakasaka wu kavwanga mu vinu dinsa. Wusoka wo ha nsongi yi dyadya, mboki wumuhaana kanwa dyo na wuta ti: «Kingileeno tutala, tala ti Eliya waakwiza mu kulumuna ha kulunsi!». <verse eid="MRK 15:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 15:37" />Kansi Yesu wulooka mu ngolo na wufwa.<verse eid="MRK 15:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 15:38" />Mulele wu kihinga kilongo wukakuka ha kati-kati mu ndambu zole kutonina ku yulu natee ku banda. <verse eid="MRK 15:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 15:39" />Mfumu yi zimbulu-mbulu nkama (100) wuba ha ntadisi yi Yesu, bu kayena bwedi kafwila, wuta ti: «Kedika, muntu bewuwu Mwana Nzambi kabedi!» <verse eid="MRK 15:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 15:40" />Bakento baba batelama kitatu, bedi talanga. Ha kati dyawu ha ba na Maliya mwisi-Mangadala, Maliya ngudi yi Zaki wuntwenya na yi Yosi, mpe Salomi. <verse eid="MRK 15:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 15:41" />Bedi kwe landingi Yesu bu baba ku mbanza yi Ngalili mu kwe musadisi. Mpe na bakento babingi bahiika batomboka nandi ku mbanza Yelusalemi.<verse eid="MRK 15:41" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Batuula nitu yi Yesu mu ndyamu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:57-61">Mat 27.57-61</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:50-56">Luk 23.50-56</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:38-42">Yoa 19.38-42</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 15:42" />Nkokila yitula, kiba kilumbu ki bedi kubikanga mukembo, mpila mosi ti tekila kilumbu ki saba kitula. <verse eid="MRK 15:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 15:43" />Yosefi mwisi-Alimate wuyiza, mpe wuba kinama ki mfunu ha kati di kabu di zinkuluntu zi Bayudayo, na wedi kingilanga nyizulu yi Kimfumu ki Nzambi. Wuyenda yenikina Pilatu mu kibakala mu mulomba nitu yi Yesu. <verse eid="MRK 15:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 15:44" />Pilatu wuyituku bu kayuwa ti fwidingi. Wulomba batumisa mfumu yi zimbulu-mbulu nkama (100) mu mufuula, tala ti Yesu ntama kafwidingi. <verse eid="MRK 15:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 15:45" />Bu kamana yuwa mpolo ku mfumu yi zimbulu-mbulu nkama (100), wuhaana luve ku Yosefi mu bonga nitu yi Yesu. <verse eid="MRK 15:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 15:46" />Yosefi wusumba mulele wu lino, wukulumuna Yesu ha kulunsi, wuzinga yo mulele wu lino na wutuula yo mu ndyamu yitobolo mu tadi. Mboki wunengomona tadi didinene mu kanga nkotolo yi ndyamu. <verse eid="MRK 15:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 15:47" />Maliya mwisi-Mangadala na Maliya ngudi yi Yosi bedi talanga huuma ha bedi tuula nitu andi.<verse eid="MRK 15:47" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="MRK 16" />
  <para style="s1">Mfulukulu yi Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 28:1-8">Mat 28.1-8</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 24:1-12">Luk 24.1-12</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 20:1-10">Yoa 20.1-10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 16:1" />Kilumbu ki saba bu kihyoka, Maliya mwisi-Mangadala, Maliya ngudi yi Zaki, mpe Salomi basumba mafuta mamfuku yimbote, mwanki benda bakusa mo mu nitu yi Yesu. <verse eid="MRK 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 16:2" />Kilumbu ki lumingu mu mene na mene, mwini bu wutona mu totoka, bayenda ku ndyamu. <verse eid="MRK 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 16:3" />Batelasana yawu na yawu ti: «Naani watunengomonina tadi dii ha nkotolo yi ndyamu e?» <verse eid="MRK 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 16:4" />Kansi bu basendola meso, bayena ti tadi diba nkatika didinene diba dinengomono. <verse eid="MRK 16:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 16:5" />Bakota mu ndyamu, bayena toko dimosi diba dizakala ku kooko ku lubakala na dilwata zwele dimpembe, mpe bayena bunkuta bubwingi. <verse eid="MRK 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 16:6" />Wubateela ti: «Luyenandi bunkuta ko. Yesu mwisi-Nazaleti luna sosa, yondowo wu bakomini ha kulunsi. Kasiidi ha ko, fulukidi mu bafwa! Yizeeno lutala huma ha bamutuudidi. <verse eid="MRK 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 16:7" />Yendeeno luta ku milongoki myandi na ku Petelo ti: “Wulutekididi ku mbanza yi Ngalili, kwakoko lwaamuyenina bonso bu kaluteela wo.” » <verse eid="MRK 16:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 16:8" />Batotoka mu ndyamu na kintekoto, mayindu mawu yeku-yeku, ni bawoka. Mpe bata wo ku kani muntu ko, mu dyambu ti baba na bunkuta bungitukulu.</para>
  <para style="s" vid="MRK 16:8">Yesu wuyenika ku milongoki myandi</para>
  <para style="r" vid="MRK 16:8">(<ref loc="MAT 28:9-10">Mat 28.9-10</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 28:18-20">18-20</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 24:13-53">Luk 24.13-53</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 20:11-18">Yoa 20.11-18</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 1:6-8">Mav 1.6-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 16:8">[<verse eid="MRK 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 16:9" /><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">16.9 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kutonina mu kibuku ki 9 natee kibuku ki 20, misamu bemimi mii mu mikanda mintete ko </char></note> Yesu wufuluka kilumbu ki lumingu mu mene, wuyenikina ntete Maliya mwisi-Mangadala, yondowo wu kakuma mpeve nsambwadi zimbi. <verse eid="MRK 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 16:10" />Wuyenda zabikisa wo ku yobobo baba nandi na baba mu kifwidi, mpe bedi dilanga. <verse eid="MRK 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 16:11" />Kansi bu bayuwa ti wuu wumoyo na wumuyena, yawu bamukwikila ko.<verse eid="MRK 16:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 16:12" />Ku manima, Yesu wuyenikina milongoki myole myedi kwenda ku bwala mu kifwani kihiika. <verse eid="MRK 16:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 16:13" />Bu bavutuka, bayadila myo ku bahiika, kansi babakwikila ko.<verse eid="MRK 16:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 16:14" />Ku manima, Yesu wuyenika ku milongoki kumi na wumosi bu baba ha meza. Wubasemba mu dyambu ti baba na kiminu ko na babisa mu kwikila yobobo bamuyena wufuluka mu bafwa. <verse eid="MRK 16:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 16:15" />Mboki wubateela ti: «Yendeeno mu nza yimvimba mu samuna Musamu Wumbote ku bantu bamvimba. <verse eid="MRK 16:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 16:16" />Yondowo waakwikila na waabotoko waavuuka, kansi yondowo waalembolo kwikikila, waatambula nsembolo. <verse eid="MRK 16:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 16:17" />Taleeno bidimbu byaalanda yobobo baakwikila: mu nkumbu ani, baakuma mpeve zimbi, baazonza ndinga zinzenza, <verse eid="MRK 16:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 16:18" />baasimba zinyoka mu moko mawu, tala ti banwini bima bimbi bikwe hondanga, kani musamu wumpasi waababwidila ko, baatentika moko ku zimbevo, mpe yawu baanyaka.»<verse eid="MRK 16:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu wutomboka ku yulu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 24:50-53">Luk 24.50-53</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 1:9-11">Mav 1.9-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 16:19" />Bu kamanisa mu zonza bobo, Mfumu Yesu bamutombola ku yulu, mpe wuyenda zakala ha lweka lu lubakala lu Nzambi. <verse eid="MRK 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 16:20" />Milongoki miyenda samuna Musamu Wumbote ku ndambu ka ndambu. Mfumu wedi salanga kintwadi nawu mpe wedi lonkanga mu bidimbu ti Mambu mandi makedika madi.]<verse eid="MRK 16:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 16" />
</usx>